, 5\",\"town\":\"Palencia\",\"postal_code\":\"34004\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.0040957,\"longitude\":-4.5117491},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfiteltemplo.es\",\"phone\":\"979032500\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfiteltemplo\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfiteltemplo\"}},{\"id_application\":\"93986480\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"HIIT Training\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/93986480\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"1 Rue de l\\u0027Europe\",\"town\":\"Saint-Denis\",\"postal_code\":\"97400\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":-20.8784675,\"longitude\":55.4484856},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"hiit.training.974@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"hiittraining974\",\"facebook\":\"HIIT Training 974\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3208\",\"name\":\"Pure Performanc e Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3208\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3208\\/featured_images\\/philosophie1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3208\\/featured_images\\/philosophie2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3208\\/featured_images\\/philosophie3.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Hugo-Junkers-Stra\\u00dfe 3a\",\"town\":\"Pulheim\",\"postal_code\":\"50259\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.9853734,\"longitude\":6.8232813},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"andi@ppcrossfit.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 17664017155\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"pureperformancecrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/PurePerformanceCrossfit\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"96091321\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Seahorse\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/96091321\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/96091321\\/featured_images\\/logo_crossfit_istres%20%281%29.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"6 Rue des cordonniers\",\"town\":\"Istres\",\"postal_code\":\"13800\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.5172667,\"longitude\":4.9627742},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@team-muge.fr\",\"phone\":\"04 86 37 22 00\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_istres\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"24195270\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Vinca\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/24195270\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Route des Ayes, 42\",\"town\":\"Saint-Georges-d\\u0027Esp\\u00e9ranche\",\"postal_code\":\"38790\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.5576859,\"longitude\":5.087363},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfit.vinca@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"0601463486\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3174\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Myrmica\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":null,\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3174\\/featured_images\\/15740761_597913023749605_5900826067498809412_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3174\\/featured_images\\/16251880_611565819050992_9209140568468097552_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3174\\/featured_images\\/20121385_702363329971240_175568019103522399_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3174\\/featured_images\\/36863923_881429472064624_6893077332148355072_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3174\\/featured_images\\/61558841_1099686923572210_4643757767587266560_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"14 Rue L\\u00e9onard de Vinci\",\"town\":\"Le Plessis-P\\u00e2te\",\"postal_code\":\"91220\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.6187427,\"longitude\":2.3304146},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitmyrmica@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+33 6 59 08 12 14\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitmyrmica\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2622\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Munich\",\"description\":\"Im Jahr 2010 startete CrossFit Munich mit f\\u00fcnf Mitgliedern und den zwei Trainern Alex und Daniel in den Boxalltag.\\nDurch kontinuierlichen Zuwachs wurde Monat f\\u00fcr Monat das Trainingsangebot erweitert und schon bald nach einer neuen, gr\\u00f6\\u00dferen Location gesucht. Nach erfolgreicher Suche wurde in diesem Zusammenhang die CrossFit M\\u00fcnchen GmbH gegr\\u00fcndet, um professionelle Strukturen zu schaffen. Im M\\u00fcnchner Osten wurden im Werksviertel Raum f\\u00fcr die Mitglieder geschaffen. \\n\\n\\u003Ciframe width=\\u0022100%\\u0022 height=\\u0022315\\u0022 src=\\u0022https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/bOU8vU3xDXA\\u0022 frameborder=\\u00220\\u0022 allow=\\u0022accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\\u0022 allowfullscreen\\u003E\\u003C\\/iframe\\u003E\\n\\nNun, nach einigen Jahren an Training und vielen vergangenen CrossFit Open, kann CrossFit Munich \\u00fcber 800 festen Mitglieder (Stand Juni 2017) verteilt auf zwei Locations verzeichnen. An beiden Standorten bieten wir als gr\\u00f6\\u00dfte Box Deutschlands wochentags Stunden von 06:30 bis 21:30 an. Auch am Wochenende wird den Mitgliedern ein umfangreicher Stundenplan geboten. Diese \\u00fcber 220 Trainingsstunden werden von einem Team bestehend aus  5 Festangestellten, 2 Auszubildenden und \\u00fcber 20 Trainern die als Freiberufler oder Minijobber t\\u00e4tig sind gehalten. Trotz dieser gro\\u00dfen Zahl Beteiligten herrscht bei uns eine famili\\u00e4re Atmosph\\u00e4re, da die Trainer ehemals als Mitglieder bei uns starten und unsere Werte dadurch seit vielen Jahren leben.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2622\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2622\\/featured_images\\/1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2622\\/featured_images\\/2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2622\\/featured_images\\/3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2622\\/featured_images\\/4.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Frankfurter Ring 255,\",\"town\":\"M\\u00fcnchen\",\"postal_code\":\"80807\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.1863617,\"longitude\":11.6055751},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitmunich.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 (0) 1739045196\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitmunich\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Munich-Power-and-Skills-188439761197482\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3128\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Hiesfeld\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3128\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3128\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-20%20um%2013.33.58.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3128\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-20%20um%2013.34.30.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3128\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-20%20um%2013.35.24.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Kurt-Schumacher-Str. 275\",\"town\":\"Dinslaken\",\"postal_code\":\"46539\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.558431,\"longitude\":6.7940293},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfit-hiesfeld.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 1629619060\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfithiesfeld\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Hiesfeld-2066988706901727\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"34724556\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Simply Athletic\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/34724556\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/34724556\\/featured_images\\/image1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/34724556\\/featured_images\\/image2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/34724556\\/featured_images\\/image3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/34724556\\/featured_images\\/image4.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/34724556\\/featured_images\\/image5.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Village de Jarry\",\"town\":\"Baie Mahault\",\"postal_code\":\"97122\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":16.2431018,\"longitude\":-61.5548482},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"simply-crossfit@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"+590 690 57-5972\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"simply_crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/SimplyCrossFit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2770\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Mallorca\",\"description\":\"WELCOME TO CROSSFIT MALLORCA \\u2013 A FUN, FRIENDLY AND WELCOMING GYM\\nFounded in 2011 by Rob Martin, CrossFit Mallorca was the first box on the island. Since then we have gone from strength to strength. We are now in our fully equipped 550 sq metre space on the Son Bugadelles estate in Santa Ponsa on the South West coast of Mallorca.\\n\\nBetween them our coaches speak many languages primarily English, Spanish and German.\\n\\nIf you come in with a willingness to learn you can achieve fitness beyond your expectations.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2770\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2770\\/featured_images\\/55879628_648420178933688_6631895593515023348_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2770\\/featured_images\\/57232479_303676430524341_7162455005183023431_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2770\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-open-mallorca.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Carrer de la Mar Mediterr\\u00e0nia,\",\"town\":\"Santa Pon\\u00e7a\",\"postal_code\":\"07180\",\"country\":\"Illes Balears\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.5670109,\"longitude\":2.5812914},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitmallorca.com\",\"phone\":\"634 311 358\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitmallorca\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/TheCrossFitMallorca\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2783\",\"name\":\"Crossfit La Muralla\",\"description\":\"Primer Box Oficial CrossFit en el \\u00e1rea de Fuengirola-Mijas\\nM\\u00e1s de 300m\\u00b2, vestuarios, Rack para 30 puestos de dominadas, 4 racks para bench press-squats-press, etc, 8 puestos de muscle ups, 2 cuerdas de trepa de 5 metros, remos Concept 2, Assault Airbikes e infinidad de material para clases de hasta 16 personas\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2783\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2783\\/featured_images\\/crossfit%20la%20muralla.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2783\\/featured_images\\/crossfit%20la%20muralla2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2783\\/featured_images\\/crossfit%20la%20muralla3.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Santa Fabiola 4\",\"town\":\"Mijas\",\"postal_code\":\"29650\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":36.546682,\"longitude\":-4.635502},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitlamuralla.com\",\"phone\":\"610150088\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitlamuralla\",\"facebook\":\"Crossfit-La-Muralla\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2842\",\"name\":\"Greywolves Crossfit\",\"description\":\"Greywolves. CrossFit Cantabria fue el primer Box oficial de CrossFit en el conjunto del Norte de Espa\\u00f1a. Abrimos puertas all\\u00e1 por 2012, cuando pr\\u00e1cticamente nadie en Cantabria hab\\u00eda o\\u00eddo hablar del CrossFit y lo que m\\u00e1s escuch\\u00e1bamos era eso de \\u201c\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 es lo que hac\\u00e9is? \\u00bfCross\\u2026\\u00bfqu\\u00e9?\\u201d. Han pasado ya dos intensos a\\u00f1os de aquello, a trav\\u00e9s de nuestros entrenamientos hemos roto muchos de los clich\\u00e9s asociados al CrossFit y hemos presentado y difundido este deporte en Cantabria.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2842\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2842\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-b1c566a2eb0b2cd748cdc96a0c82cc8b.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2842\\/featured_images\\/mas-gimnasio.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2842\\/featured_images\\/page3_img3_f15ca84afaec9f374e766a1c37ccbd97.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2842\\/featured_images\\/parami.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Aeropuerto, 30\",\"town\":\"Santander\",\"postal_code\":\"39600\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3825492,\"longitude\":-3.9754052},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitcantabria@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"942260028\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"greywolvescrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@GreywolvesCrossFit\"}},{\"id_application\":\"54899392\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Essentia Sport \\u0026 Coaching \",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/54899392\\/logo