85 71\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2555\",\"name\":\"CrossFit FireStorm\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2555\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2555\\/featured_images\\/12694850_1645736979022797_305237154139167133_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2555\\/featured_images\\/49047644_2166637933599363_5366410028301418496_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2555\\/featured_images\\/49810325_2169758653287291_2772062039906975744_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2555\\/featured_images\\/50567757_2182085548721268_3063675961229705216_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2555\\/featured_images\\/50903658_2182085625387927_3678089514166779904_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Tuscolana, 74\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00182\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.8821939,\"longitude\":12.5170691},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitfirestorm@yahoo.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 06 69354843\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_firestorm\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitfirestorm\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2609\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Garbagnate\",\"description\":\"Il CrossFit \\u00e8 un occasione per tutti, richiama sia uomini che donne. E\\u2019 un programma di rafforzamento e condizionamento fisico pensato per aiutare le persone a conquistare un benessere completo e generale.\\n\\nE\\u2019 un allenamento completo a 360\\u00b0 che offre una grande variet\\u00e0 di esercizi senza possibilit\\u00e0 di annoiarsi.\\n\\nFa conoscere alle persone il bilanciere, la ginnastica, la fatica.\\n\\nIl CrossFit combina diverse discipline sportive, movimenti funzionali che vengono eseguiti a una elevata intensit\\u00e0 e che mimano i gesti naturali e quotidiani del corpo umano.\\n\\nUn Crossfitter deve padroneggiare i 10 punti fondamentali del fitness:\\n\\nResistenza cardiorespiratoria;\\nResistenza muscolare;\\nForza;\\nFlessibilit\\u00e0;\\nPotenza;\\nVelocit\\u00e0;\\nCoordinazione;\\nAgilit\\u00e0;\\nEquilibrio;\\nPrecisione.\\nGli allenamenti sono funzionali, adattabili e modulabili pertanto qualunque sia la Vostra et\\u00e0 o forma fisica potrete iniziare a praticare questo sport.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2609\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2609\\/featured_images\\/IMG_1476-2-1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2609\\/featured_images\\/IMG_1479-2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2609\\/featured_images\\/IMG_1598-2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2609\\/featured_images\\/IMG_1684-2.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"via Mafalda 15\",\"town\":\"Milano\",\"postal_code\":\"20024\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.5799793,\"longitude\":9.0785463},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitgarbagnatemilanese.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 335 148 3504\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitGarbagnate\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2709\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Athlevo\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2709\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2709\\/featured_images\\/SabineSkiba_Athlevo-5082.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2709\\/featured_images\\/SabineSkiba_Athlevo-5320.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2709\\/featured_images\\/kettle-sm.jpg