677252992320860_8635320763089395782_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via dei Prati Fiscali, 403\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00141\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.9418613,\"longitude\":12.5092343},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitparioli@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 06 6449 3499\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitparioli\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitParioli\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3142\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Cham\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":null,\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Badstrasse 15\",\"town\":\"Cham\",\"postal_code\":\"93413\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.2214835,\"longitude\":12.6708113},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitcham.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 15904222268\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitcham\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"60396660\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit K\\u014dy\\u014d\",\"description\":\"BIEN COMMENCER CHEZ PLUS ULTRA\\n\\nLes activit\\u00e9s propos\\u00e9es par Plus Ultra sont \\u00e0 la port\\u00e9e de tous. Que vous ayez un pass\\u00e9 sportif ou non et peu importe vos objectifs, notre \\u00e9quipe trouvera toujours le moyen d\\u2019adapter vos s\\u00e9ances afin d\\u2019am\\u00e9liorer vos comp\\u00e9tences et repousser vos limites.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/60396660\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/60396660\\/featured_images\\/personal-trainer-22.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"25 Avenue du parc de l\\u0027horloge\",\"town\":\"P\\u00e9renchies\",\"postal_code\":\"59840\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.6640155,\"longitude\":2.9727941},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfithexagone@gmx.com\",\"phone\":\"06 65 99 18 56\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/crossfitkoyo\\/\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/pucrossfitbyplusultra\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"94022398\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Adendorf \\/ Alcedo Spa\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/94022398\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Scharnebecker Weg 23\",\"town\":\"Adendorf\",\"postal_code\":\"21365\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":53.2903489,\"longitude\":10.4575625},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@alcedo-spa.de\",\"phone\":\"0049 4131 70 77 77\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"56711206\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit du D\\u00f4me\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/56711206\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"5 route du D\\u00f4me\",\"town\":\"Chaponost\",\"postal_code\":\"69630\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.6952751,\"longitude\":4.7649639},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitdudome@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"04 72 49 94 55\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_du_dome\",\"facebook\":\"CrossFit Du D\\u00f4me\"}},{\"id_application\":\"53058626\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Platinum Fitness\",\"description\":\"OUR PHILOSOPHY\\n01\\nAt PLATINUM we specialise in maximizing our varied clientele by offering one of the most comprehensive personal training on the island. From sports performance to weight loss to living an overall healthier lifestyle, PLATINUM is your way to go. Our coaches are some of the best on the island. Not only do they continually educate themselves, but they strive to become better athletes at what they do while learning how to do it better.\\n\\nWHAT WE HAVE\\nTO OFFER\\n02\\nIf you are looking to lose weight, or need a jumpstart getting back in shape, our coaches will provide the knowledge and hands-on training to help you become and remain fit. Whether recovering from an injury or surgery or aiming to reach a particular goal in a particular timeframe, our staff has a wealth of training experience and knowledge to put you in the right path.\\n\\n\\nSET HIGH FITNESS GOALS\\nAfter you decide to start training we will make sure you get the best fitness program. Our sport experts and latest sports equipment are the winning combination.\\n\\n\\nQUALITY EQUIPMENT\\nPLATINUM offers a wide range of SportsArt equipment. We are proud to be working alongside with SportsArt, who are innovators in modern fitness and a pioneers in green systems.\\n\\nv\\nHEALTHY NUTRITION PLAN\\nOur Personal Trainers are qualified and equipped with the knowledge to guide you in making the best choices in your daily meal plans. We also work with other sports nutritionists and dietitians to assist you in taking your nutrition plan to another level.\\n\\n\\nSHOWER SERVICE\\nThe use of showers are available to all our members.\\n\\n\\nUNIQUE TO YOUR NEEDS\\nWe do not believe in a \\u201cOne For All\\u201d principle. Every human being is different from one another and we consistently strive to teach, educate and support our clients individually to help them reach their goals.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/53058626\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/1Captura.JPG\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/292374006_458150942979983_5547755216658826582_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/2Captura.JPG\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/4Captura.JPG\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/5Captura.JPG\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/6Captura.JPG\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/53058626\\/featured_images\\/Captura.JPG\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Triq in-Naxxar, 91, 93\",\"town\":\"Birkirkara\",\"postal_code\":\"9047\",\"country\":\"Malta\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":35.8982742,\"longitude\":14.4588961},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@platinumfitness.com.mt\",\"phone\":\"+356 21443348\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"platinum.mt\",\"facebook\":\"PlatinumFitnessMalta\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2757\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Leipzig\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2757\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2757\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-05-15%20um%2010.32.26.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2757\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-05-15%20um%2010.32.32.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2757\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-05-15%20um%2010.32.38.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2757\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-05-15%20um%2010.33.00.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Angerstra\\u00dfe 40 \\u2013 42\",\"town\":\"Leipzig\",\"postal_code\":\"04177\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.3408647,\"longitude\":12.3347978},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"kontakt@crossfit-leipzig.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 34121948553\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitleipzig\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossfitLeipzig\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3188\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Sennestadt\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/featured_images\\/SG-CF-0008.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/featured_images\\/SG-CF-0095.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/featured_images\\/SG-CF-0119.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/featured_images\\/SG-CF-0147.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/featured_images\\/SG-CF-0149.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3188\\/featured_images\\/SG-CF-0175-1.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Uhlenflucht\\u00a08\",\"town\":\"Bielefeld\",\"postal_code\":\"33689\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.9605115,\"longitude\":8.5869863},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@halfwaythereperformance.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 52059916911\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"halfwaythereperformance\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/dialog\\/share?app_id=5303202981\\u0026display=popup\\u0026href=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.crossfitsennestadt.de%2F\\u0026redirect_uri=https%3a%2f%2fstatic.addtoany.com%2fmenu%2fthanks.html%23url%3dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.crossfitsennestadt.de%2F\\u0026quote=\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2954\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Tilenus\",\"description\":\"Box oficial de CrossFit en Gij\\u00f3n\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2954\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2954\\/featured_images\\/61276816_507001049836681_7915134477485998080_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Camino de la Xacona, 205\",\"town\":\"Gij\\u00f3n\",\"postal_code\":\"33392\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.4969615,\"longitude\":-5.7058396},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"tilenuscrossfit@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"984834857\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"tilenuscrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@Tilenus-CrossFit-259671864569602\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2873\",\"name\":\"Feel Crossfit\",\"description\":\"En Feel CrossFit encontrar\\u00e1s personal cualificado y certificado oficialmente con amplia experiencia en el mundo del deporte, que har\\u00e1 que cumplas todos tus objetivos fitness y descubras que tu cuerpo es una m\\u00e1quina bien engrasada que, con la gu\\u00eda adecuada y el entrenamiento perfecto puede llegar a l\\u00edmites que nunca imaginaste. \\u00bfEst\\u00e1s preparado?\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2873\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2873\\/featured_images\\/12670894_1744482242464028_4915465912469039450_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2873\\/featured_images\\/Box2-710x375.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2873\\/featured_images\\/Eventos-Crossfit.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pol. El refugio, Calle A, 14\",\"town\":\"Sevilla\",\"postal_code\":\"41006\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.3642746,\"longitude\":-5.9606719},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@feelcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"664064723\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"feelcrossfitsevilla\",\"facebook\":\"@feelcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2948\",\"name\":\"One Mile Crossfit\",\"description\":\"Forging Elite Fitness\\nBox oficial de CrossFit ubicado en Molins de Rei, Barcelona.\\nM\\u00e1s de 750m2, equipado con el mejor material del mercado.\\n\\u00a1Es hora de cambiar tu vida!\\n\\u00bfA que esperas?\\n\\u00a1Nosotros te ayudaremos!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2948\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2948\\/featured_images\\/52039530_611199539331463_2913808815241045533_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2948\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Francesc Layret, 19\",\"town\":\"Molins de Rei\",\"postal_code\":\"08750\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.4040357,\"longitude\":2.022216},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@onemilecrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"623365394\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"onemilecrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@1milecrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":\"78501917\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Neo CrossFit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/78501917\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/78501917\\/featured_images\\/Captura%20de%20pantalla%202022-06-20%20084243.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"318 BIS RUE ALBERT DE DION\",\"town\":\"Issoire\",\"postal_code\":\"63500\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.54151,\"longitude\":3.248128},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"neocrossfit@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"0643472856\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"neo.crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2955\",\"name\":\"OVD Crossfit\",\"description\":\"- Luchar contra el sedentarismo y los malos h\\u00e1bitos alimenticios como base. \\n\\n \\n\\n-Adaptar a cada atleta, independientemente de su nivel, estado de forma, edad, problemas de salud, movilidad... los entrenamientos, para que estos no supongan un riesgo para su salud y supongan un reto constante. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Hacer de cada d\\u00eda un nuevo reto, no caer en la rutina, EVOLUCIONAR!!! \\n\\n \\n\\n- Seguir form\\u00e1ndonos y aprendiendo para vosotros. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Conocerte, saber cu\\u00e1les son tus l\\u00edmites y superarlos juntos. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Identificar cuando tienes un mal d\\u00eda y cuando est\\u00e1s a pleno rendimiento. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Machacar la t\\u00e9cnica de cada ejercicio y estar encima tuyo hasta que la domines. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Hacer de nuestro Box tu casa y de tus compa\\u00f1eros, tus amigos. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Fomentar la Comunidad CrossFit, dentro y fuera del Box.\\n\\n \\n\\n- Seguir una planificaci\\u00f3n estudiada, con sentido y que te ayude a mejorar cada d\\u00eda. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Tratarte como uno m\\u00e1s , seas un competidor de \\u00e9lite o est\\u00e9s inici\\u00e1ndote. \\n\\n \\n\\n- Llamarte por tu nombre y hacerte preguntas como : \\n\\n\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 tal hoy en el trabajo?\\n\\n\\u00bfHas dormido bien?\\n\\n\\u00bfMuchas agujetas del entrenamiento de ayer? ... \\n\\n \\n\\n- Trabajar constantemente para mejorar nuestras instalaciones y servicios.\\n\\n \\n\\nEs f\\u00e1cil escribirlo o explicarlo pero dif\\u00edcil entenderlo hasta que lo vivas. Ven a probarlo, \\u00a1que no te lo cuenten!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2955\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2955\\/featured_images\\/unnamed.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Tenderina alta, 55, Bajo Izq\",\"town\":\"Oviedo\",\"postal_code\":\"33010\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3650675,\"longitude\":-5.8365146},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@ovdcf.es\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"ovdcf\",\"facebook\":\"@OVieDoCrossFit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3038\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Travesia\",\"description\":\"BOX afiliado de CrossFit, equipado con las primeras marcas mundiales ELEIKO y MAXIMUS, los mejores coaches que te ayudaran a sacar lo mejor de ti mismo y una comunidad con la que compartir tus logros y experiencias.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3038\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3038\\/featured_images\\/42472030_233929200612378_4982599235196157952_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3038\\/featured_images\\/48016027_257506064921358_749092380036038656_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3038\\/featured_images\\/venueHome_1024x576_WhatsApp%20Image%202019-02-28%20at%2011.16.19_1554134434887116_admin.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Travessia Industrial 107 - 109\",\"town\":\"Hospitalet de Llobregat\",\"postal_code\":\"08907\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.352249,\"longitude\":2.1035513},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfit-travessia.com\",\"phone\":\"640 969 732\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitravessia\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitravessia\"}},{\"id_application\":\"67112441\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"L\\u0027ar\\u00e8ne Fontenay\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/67112441\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/67112441\\/featured_images\\/40062187_683045125395991_6902738753706524672_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/67112441\\/featured_images\\/45805366_721243224909514_5712825297074651136_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Rue Roger-Salengro (Batiment F)\",\"town\":\"Fontenay-sous-Bois\",\"postal_code\":\"94120\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.8490543,\"longitude\":2.4891282},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"fontenay@larenecrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"0650709330\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"larenecrossfit_fontenay\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/larenecrossfitfontenay\"}},{\"id_application\":\"13219481\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Escale CrossFit CLICHY ASNIERES COURBEVOIE\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/13219481\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/13219481\\/featured_images\\/44802398_579202555831201_3002398915493363712_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/13219481\\/featured_images\\/Capture.PNG\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Gare de B\\u00e9con-les-Bruy\\u00e8res - Rue Madiraa\",\"town\":\"Courbevoie\",\"postal_code\":\"92400\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.9058723,\"longitude\":2.2685083},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@escalecrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"0764743765\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"escale_crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/EscaleCrossFit\"}},{\"id_application\":\"99794999\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Tarvos\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/99794999\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"7 Rue Jules Ferry\",\"town\":\"Bourges\",\"postal_code\":\"18000\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":47.081012,\"longitude\":2.398782},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@crossfit-tarvos.fr\",\"phone\":\"659068187\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfittarvos\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Tarvos-752942608408618\"}},{\"id_application\":\"34587859\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"My Training\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/34587859\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"6 Rue Rosa Parks\",\"town\":\"Les Ponts-de-C\\u00e9\",\"postal_code\":\"49130\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":47.4459389,\"longitude\":-0.5109614},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"sonnycoachsportif@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+33670080662\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"_my_training__\",\"facebook\":\"Sonny Coaching Sportif\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2818\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Maherit Rio\",\"description\":\"Crossfit Maherit Rio nace con la idea de crear un ambiente de trabajo donde se disfrute al 100% cada sesi\\u00f3n y acabemos con una sonrisa y una grata sensaci\\u00f3n de bienestar tras un entrenamiento intenso. Podamos disfrutar de un entorno privilegiado y compaginar todo tipo de entrenamientos de Crossfit dentro y fuera del Box. Con clases reducidas, podremos controlar mucho mejor a los atletas evitando lo m\\u00e1ximo posible las incorrecciones en la ejecuci\\u00f3n de un movimiento t\\u00e9cnico. Si a\\u00fan tienes dudas sobre si este es tu deporte definitivo, vente a probar de manera gratuita* y sin compromiso, y podr\\u00e1s comprobar si esto es as\\u00ed. \\u00a1Os esperamos!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2818\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2818\\/featured_images\\/Josh-Deadlift-940x726.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2818\\/featured_images\\/rowing-bw_web.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2818\\/featured_images\\/shutterstock_123446239.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Aniceto Marinas, 26\",\"town\":\"Madrid\",\"postal_code\":\"28008\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":40.422036,\"longitude\":-3.7249347},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitmaheritrio.es\",\"phone\":\"914529056\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_maheritrio\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossfitMadridRio\"}},{\"id_application\":\"95397904\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Crossfit Saint-Pierre\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/95397904\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/95397904\\/featured_images\\/19247915_1887171208259900_8408453120151133423_n.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/95397904\\/featured_images\\/27657544_1890833921226962_2068906869310553012_n.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.e