3727107\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2785\",\"name\":\"Acero Crossfit\",\"description\":\"Bienvenido al primer Box Afiliado de Toledo. \\u00bf\\u00c9sto qu\\u00e9 significa? Que somos el primer (y hasta el momento \\u00fanico) centro de la regi\\u00f3n donde podr\\u00e1s practicar CrossFit con instructores cualificados y certificados oficialmente para ello.\\nEsto significa que el resto de gimnasios de la provincia, aunque anuncien que ofrecen CrossFit a sus clientes, lo que realmente est\\u00e1n ofreciendo es un suced\\u00e1neo o \\u201calgo parecido a\\u201d CrossFit.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2785\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2785\\/featured_images\\/20130912_203327.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2785\\/featured_images\\/IMG-20140111-WA0000.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/ R\\u00edo March\\u00e9s, n\\u00ba 77\",\"town\":\"Toledo\",\"postal_code\":\"45007\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.8712087,\"longitude\":-3.9517191},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"acerocrossfit@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"687837421\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"acerocrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@Acero-CrossFit-Toledo\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2911\",\"name\":\"CrossFit AK 65\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":null,\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2911\\/featured_images\\/33617009_1733714813350567_1034286991698558976_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2911\\/featured_images\\/53915094_2176422885746422_5558928436946272256_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2911\\/featured_images\\/58680928_2253520498036660_2397240119431004160_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2911\\/featured_images\\/59636370_2253520388036671_6089512362933485568_n.