lackbandcrossfit.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 15901693930\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/blackbandcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":\"50863209\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Viking Spirit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/50863209\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"45 Laschamps de Chavanat\",\"town\":\"Saint-Fiel\",\"postal_code\":\"23000\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":46.2049404,\"longitude\":1.9047691},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"cf_vikingspirit@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"0609735781\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitvikingspirit23\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3042\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Puigcerd\\u00e1\",\"description\":\"Somos el primer box oficial de Cerdanya y el mas alto de Espa\\u00f1a. Nos dedicamos 100% a CrossFit. Que sea en Catal\\u00e1n, Castellano, Franc\\u00e9s o Ingles, lo mezclamos todo para formar una familia que te bienvenida y te ayuda en tu viaje a la salud y el rendimiento f\\u00edsico, o si pasas por Puigcerda y quieres WOD\\u0027ar con nosotros!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3042\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3042\\/featured_images\\/49895393_2228575794065651_8575300195313516544_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3042\\/featured_images\\/59648080_2301372480119315_1799265424970350592_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Carrer Puigmal 1\",\"town\":\"Puigcerd\\u00e1\",\"postal_code\":\"17520\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.428441,\"longitude\":1.9263739},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitpuigcerda.com\",\"phone\":\"676 589 041\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"cfpuig\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFitPuigcerda\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2928\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Txindoki\",\"description\":\"En CrossFit Txindoki te ofrecemos el mejor y m\\u00e1s amplio servicio, para que tu esfuerzo se vea recompensado con los mejores resultados. Por eso, ponemos a tu disposici\\u00f3n todo lo necesario.\\n\\n \\n\\nInstalaciones\\n\\n400m2 de instalaciones, area de cardio, equipo completo y de primer nivel, y todo lo necesario para que te sientas como en casa.\\n\\nFisioterapia\\n\\nPonemos a tu servicio a los mejores especialistas que nos ayudaran a que tu cuerpo se recupere eficientemente. \\u00a1Que nada te detenga!\\n\\nNutrici\\u00f3n\\n\\nLa parte nutricional es fundamental para conseguir tus mejores resultados, te ofrecemos planes personalizados. \\u00a1QUE TU MAQUINA DISPONGA DEL COMBUSTIBLE PERFECTO!\\n\\nSeguimiento\\n\\nMedimos tu punto de partida en tus capacidades f\\u00edsicas (potencia, resistencia y fuerza), y tu fisionom\\u00eda (porcentaje de grasa, indice de masa corporal, masa magra), y le damos un seguimiento mensual para que compruebes tu crecimiento. \\u00a1ver\\u00e1s y sentir\\u00e1s los resultados de tu esfuerzo!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2928\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2928\\/featured_images\\/29749327_1110132575795288_1136917644357894323_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2928\\/featured_images\\/31729770_1128825570592655_3247817396940963840_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2928\\/featured_images\\/37765941_1198892100252668_3135092823456481280_n%20%281%29.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2928\\/featured_images\\/37765941_1198892100252668_3135092823456481280_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pol\\u00edgono Isuses, Pabell\\u00f3n 8\",\"town\":\"Arama\",\"postal_code\":\"20248\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.058508,\"longitude\":-2.1714777},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfittxindoki.com\",\"phone\":\"676 739 847\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfittxindoki\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFitTxindoki\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2595\",\"name\":\"Reebok Crossfit Officine\",\"description\":\"Reebok CrossFit O\\ufb03cine non \\u00e8 solo un box, piuttosto una grande famiglia, un luogo fatto di persone, fatica, sorrisi e sudore.\\nIl CrossFit \\u00e8 ci\\u00f2 che noi insegniamo, ogni giorno con passione a tutti coloro che hanno voglia di mettersi in forma e cambiare la propria vita, migliorando il proprio fitness.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/18671734_767884733378059_896593085155912549_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/23131028_857842911048907_785035686368841547_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/36087700_1004457169720813_854191973525880832_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/38420311_1055736081259588_6959426008411799552_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/44188843_1116524458514083_5284010522381910016_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/45591757_1131084017058127_8511396957464297472_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/46296263_1135749969924865_5154910930814894080_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/48270576_1153574271475768_6512417984181436416_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2595\\/featured_images\\/48421864_1166341690199026_886670441485801