s.com\\/applications\\/10502142\\/featured_images\\/lucian3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/10502142\\/featured_images\\/lucian4.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Rue de la for\\u00eat\",\"town\":\"Ancerville\",\"postal_code\":\"55170\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.6267009,\"longitude\":5.0120848},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitlucian@outlook.fr\",\"phone\":\"06 80 56 94 47\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"cf_lucian\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitLucianOfficiel\"}},{\"id_application\":\"73786647\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Major\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/73786647\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Zum Fruchthof 6\",\"town\":\"Buxtehude\",\"postal_code\":\"21614\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":53.4711251,\"longitude\":9.6738974},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfit-major.com\",\"phone\":\"+4917632757868\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_major\",\"facebook\":\"CrossFit Major\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3224\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Bamber\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-box-19.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-box-27.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-box-30.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/featured_images\\/start-crossfit.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/featured_images\\/start-functional-training-kurse.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3224\\/featured_images\\/start-ueber-uns.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Biegenhofstra\\u00dfe 24\",\"town\":\"Hallstadt\",\"postal_code\":\"96103\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.9173599,\"longitude\":10.8621237},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfit-bamberg.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 95197102940\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Bamberg-393825847449613\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"30519013\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"White Bull CrossFit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/30519013\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Rue d\\u0027Idalie 9\",\"town\":\"Ixelles\",\"postal_code\":\"1050\",\"country\":\"Belgium\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.8366869,\"longitude\":4.3712525},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@whitebullcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"+32494553721\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"whitebullcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"whitebullcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":\"47635011\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Queiron Crossfit\",\"description\":\"En Queiron CrossFit creemos que la eficiencia del entrenamiento se basa tanto en la programaci\\u00f3n de los ejercicios como en el ambiente en el que se desarrolla. Por ello, todo nuestro esfuerzo se centra en realizar un programa d\\u00f3nde la mejora de cada uno de nuestros miembros sea nuestra misi\\u00f3n principal y la clave de nuestro \\u00e9xito.\\n\\nEl sentido de comunidad y camarader\\u00eda est\\u00e1n presentes a diario entre todos nosotros, creando as\\u00ed un marco perfecto para la mejora y disfrute de este gran deporte. Clases reducidas y entrenadores expertos son la base para ello, pero es el ambiente positivo y el trabajo de cada uno el que alimente el resultado final.\\n\\nSin embargo, pese a que nos parece fundamental el contexto, nuestros entrenadores est\\u00e1n formados (y siguen haci\\u00e9ndolo a diario) para poder focalizarse en la t\\u00e9cnica y pr\\u00e1ctica de los movimientos.\\n\\n\\u201cQue la t\\u00e9cnica gu\\u00ede a tu fuerza\\u201d\\n\\nSea cual sea tu objetivo, tanto si eres un atleta de \\u00e9lite que busca competir, como si tu objetivo es volver a coger la forma, centraremos nuestros esfuerzos en que tu movimiento sea lo m\\u00e1s saludable posible. S\\u00f3lo as\\u00ed ver\\u00e1s verdaderos resultados.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/47635011\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/47635011\\/featured_images\\/Querion4.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/47635011\\/featured_images\\/photo1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/47635011\\/featured_images\\/photo2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/47635011\\/featured_images\\/photo3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/47635011\\/featured_images\\/photo4.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pol\\u00edgono industrial de Mutilva Baja, Calle A, Nave 43-45\",\"town\":\"Mutilva Baja\",\"postal_code\":\"31192\",\"country\":\"Espa\\u00f1a\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.7869681,\"longitude\":-1.6267332},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitnavarra@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"(+34) 948 24 68 79\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"queironcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"CrossfitNavarra\"}},{\"id_application\":\"70664161\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Rive Gauche\",\"description\":\"Notre salle ne ressemble \\u00e0 aucune autre salle de sport que vous avez d\\u00e9j\\u00e0 visit\\u00e9e. Nous sommes fiers, non seulement de fournir un entra\\u00eenement CrossFit de qualit\\u00e9, mais aussi de cr\\u00e9er un environnement motivant et dynamique rempli de personnes de tous \\u00e2ges et de toutes morphologies partageant des id\\u00e9es communes et qui s\\u0027engagent \\u00e0 travailler dur afin d\\u0027obtenir des r\\u00e9sultats durables. Nous aimons ce que nous faisons et cela se voit dans notre salle de sport. Venez faire un cours d\\u0027essai gratuit ! Transpirez, faites-vous des amis et devenez rapidement FIT !\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/70664161\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/70664161\\/featured_images\\/CRG1.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/70664161\\/featured_images\\/CRG2.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/70664161\\/featured_images\\/CRG3.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/70664161\\/featured_images\\/CRG4.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"24 Rue du Javelot\",\"town\":\"Paris\",\"postal_code\":\"75013\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.8247084,\"longitude\":2.3669321},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"no-reply@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"0623476484\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_rive_gauche\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"46307735\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Tribok CrossFit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/46307735\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/46307735\\/featured_images\\/4c928c_ff642e962cf94ea6a4e66086eaa2416b_mv2.jpeg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"4 rue de Lisbonne\",\"town\":\"Bernolsheim\",\"postal_code\":\"67170\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.756245,\"longitude\":7.69039},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@tribokcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"+33 3 90 29 59 42\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"tribokcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"Tribok CrossFit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2