265688078811136_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"2 rue du Viognier, les Tannes Basses\",\"town\":\"Clermont-l\\u0027H\\u00e9rault\",\"postal_code\":\"34800\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.6205692,\"longitude\":3.4511458},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitclermontlherault@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+33 6 72 73 73 69\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitClermontlherault\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3112\",\"name\":\"CrossFit H\\u00e9racl\\u00e8s\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":null,\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3112\\/featured_images\\/22196295_149343279003984_4057311917208716154_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3112\\/featured_images\\/22281876_149343265670652_5155112967845787902_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3112\\/featured_images\\/22365598_149343305670648_6161005325344512653_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3112\\/featured_images\\/22406438_149343349003977_4344118539774713307_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3112\\/featured_images\\/53862957_354336915171285_4437815653407129600_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"8 Boulevard Gabriel Lippmann\",\"town\":\"Gouesnou\",\"postal_code\":\"29850\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.4273142,\"longitude\":-4.4557908},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfit-heracles.fr\",\"phone\":\"+33 6 78 53 77 05\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitHeracles\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2880\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Ruzafa\",\"description\":\"Nuestro centro de CrossFit se caracteriza por su \\u00fanico objetivo, que es buscar la excelencia en la mejora y ayudar todo lo posible a las personas que buscan un entrenamiento con una programaci\\u00f3n competente.\\n\\nUno de los errores m\\u00e1s graves en este deporte, es realizar entrenamientos al azar o seguir programaciones dise\\u00f1adas para atletas avanzados y caer en el estancamiento o lo que es peor, llegar a una lesi\\u00f3n. \\nEn nuestro centro tenemos muy en cuenta el nivel del cliente, por ello los primeros d\\u00edas se analizar\\u00e1 su movilidad, su t\\u00e9cnica y su capacidad de aprendizaje.\\nEn base a ese feedback crucial adaptaremos la programaci\\u00f3n y el entrenamiento para garantizar una mejora consistente.\\nCreemos en una programaci\\u00f3n y un entrenamiento que realmente se pueda adaptar y escalar sea cual sea tu nivel.\\nEl entrenamiento que se realiza en nuestro box no solo esta programado sino tambien esta supervisado por nuestro Head Coach Vlad Matei, al cual le avalan muchos a\\u00f1os de experiencia como entrenador personal y coach de CrossFit.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2880\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2880\\/featured_images\\/9166fb_0caa6341bd1543ce8ca0ad0902c8a7c7_mv2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2880\\/featured_images\\/9166fb_6d0f4b6e46454ca786ce1b6ea4538557_mv2_d_6000_4000_s_4_2%20%281%29.jpeg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pedro III el Grande, 32, bajo\",\"town\":\"Valencia\",\"postal_code\":\"46005\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.4628527,\"longitude\":-0.3703683},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfiruzafa.com\",\"phone\":\"657503659\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitruzafa\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFitRuzafa\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2580\",\"name\":\"San Gabriel Gymnasium\",\"description\":\"Il San Gabriel \\u00e8 un ambiente esclusivo che punta sulla qualit\\u00e0 delle discipline insegnate, delle attrezzature e degli istruttori che saranno il top di ogni settore con disponibilit\\u00e0 anche di personal trainer. \\nLe discipline e le attivit\\u00e0 svolte sono le seguenti:\\nBJJ (Hung Mun) Judo(Crivelli) MMA Thai Boxe, boxe, prepugilistica (Raini Milo e Manuele) Krav Maga, Grappling, Haikido, Defence Lab Weightlifting (Massimiliano Rubino),Pilates Studio, posturale, motr. Fitness e sala pesi. Pattinaggio artistico su rotelle. Salsa Cubana. Hip hop, Box Crosstraining ePaddle Tennis. \\nll San Gabriel Gymnasium si trova all\\u0027interno di in un parco di circa 3 ettari che dona tranquillit\\u00e0 e riservatezza, con parcheggio interno e diversi servizi che lo rendono un luogo dove intrattenersi anche oltre l\\u0027allenamento. \\nPer la sua posizione geografica, per la collaborazione con l\\u0027albergo adiacente, per l\\u0027ampio parcheggio interno, per il parco privato ed una sala di 600 mq con palco, potr\\u00e0 organizzare eventi sportivi di rilievo in collaborazione con le federazioni che si avvarranno del nostro centro per effettuare stage, corsi per istruttori, gare e manifestazioni sportive. I corsi saranno organizzati per bambini, adulti ed agonisti.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2580\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2580\\/featured_images\\/18920125_1917530771853050_2356359883208051520_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2580\\/featured_images\\/42983383_2191033844502740_3280655784878276608_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2580\\/featured_images\\/43074539_2191033767836081_6034379370993287168_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Piazzale Champagnat 2\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00144\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.823074,\"longitude\":12.474306},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"sangabrielgymnasium@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 0690201478\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"urbansportsclub\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/palestraeur\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"83347903\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Hendaye\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/83347903\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/83347903\\/featured_images\\/IMG-20170326-WA0006.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/83347903\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20160520_194653.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/83347903\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20160928_203203.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/83347903\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20170306_173414.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/83347903\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20170326_093502.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Chemin Sopite\\/Z.A. Dorrondeguy\",\"town\":\"Hendaye\",\"postal_code\":\"64700\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3683691,\"longitude\":-1.7522173},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfithendaye.com\",\"phone\":\"0652845767\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_hendaye\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/Crossfit-Hendaye-299091323630516\"}},{\"id_application\":\"53977063\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Human Blossom Marlenheim\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/53977063\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"25 Rue des Pr\\u00e9s\",\"town\":\"Marlenheim\",\"postal_code\":\"67520\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.614039,\"longitude\":7.507408},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"humanblossommarlenheim@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"03 68 38 57 58\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/hbcrossfitmarlenheim\\/\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/profile.php?id=61579775565663\"}}