,\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@g3crossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"0049160 55 718 66\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"g3_crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/G3CrossFit\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"33332692\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Health \\u0026 Mobility Training\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/33332692\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Route de Sauverny 3\",\"town\":\"VERSOIX\",\"postal_code\":\"1290\",\"country\":\"Switzerland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":46.2830625,\"longitude\":6.1654375},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"healtandmobility@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"0767276415\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"health_and_mobility_studio_\",\"facebook\":\"Health and Mobility Studios 1290\\/1292\"}},{\"id_application\":\"29210144\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"XO Fitness\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/29210144\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Triq Il-Fortizza Tal-Grazzja\",\"town\":\"Ix-Xg\\u0127ajra\",\"postal_code\":\"XJR 1308\",\"country\":\"Malta\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":35.8860116,\"longitude\":14.5478426},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"xofitness@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"79602723\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2927\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Coru\\u00f1a\",\"description\":\"CrossFit Coru\\u00f1a es un centro especializado en entrenamiento funcional que se adapta a todas las personas sin importar el sexo, edad o entrenamiento f\\u00edsico previo.\\n\\nMediante nuestro equipo de profesionales, encabezado por Miguel Gago y V\\u00edctor Castro planificamos meticulosamente nuestras clases de 60 minutos para que puedas alcanzar tus objetivos de una manera divertida y variada, sin dejar de lado la seriedad, el compromiso y la intensidad que nos caracterizan. Los ejercicios practicados en CrossFit Coru\\u00f1a est\\u00e1n inspirados en los movimientos que utilizamos en nuestro d\\u00eda a d\\u00eda, con lo que la mejora de nuestro bienestar diario est\\u00e1 asegurada.\\n\\nEn CrossFit Coru\\u00f1a buscamos la excelencia, por lo que nuestras clases consistir\\u00e1n de peque\\u00f1os grupos que permitir\\u00e1n un trato personal y de calidad huyendo de las masificaciones.\\n\\nVen a conocernos y a probar tu primera clase de manera gratuita.\\n\\n\\u00bfA qu\\u00e9 esperas?\\n\\n\\u00a1\\u00danete a la manada! \\nJoin the pack!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2927\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2927\\/featured_images\\/25734452_1775277822766163_7407852026894205144_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2927\\/featured_images\\/31958635_1830195427274402_4026878611364511744_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2927\\/featured_images\\/45878969_1950045305289413_5006833175846977536_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2927\\/featured_images\\/48379693_1969281946699082_3412950720444366848_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2927\\/featured_images\\/59752627_2044390995854843_8406627870297817088_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Severo Ochoa\",\"town\":\"A Coru\\u00f1a\",\"postal_code\":\"15008\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3536161,\"longitude\":-8.4341307},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitcoruna.com\",\"phone\":\"600810508\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitcoruna\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitcoru\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2576\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Montesacro\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2576\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/n