"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2552\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2552\\/featured_images\\/10620640_1594920257503622_5947724918674121141_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2552\\/featured_images\\/16177599_1734060766922903_4138285947164620957_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2552\\/featured_images\\/16252328_1735333270128986_2782453340386625608_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2552\\/featured_images\\/16804372_1749144542081192_496149135790645445_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"via cassia 901T\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00189\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.970177,\"longitude\":12.435059},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"vesta.apssd@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 334 571 6687\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"vestacrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/vestacrossfitofficial\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3207\",\"name\":\"Crossfit CFD\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3207\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3207\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-11%20um%2009.51.05.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3207\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-11%20um%2009.51.19.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3207\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-11%20um%2009.51.35.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Reetzstr. 83\",\"town\":\"Pfinztal\",\"postal_code\":\"76327\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.9942373,\"longitude\":8.5361704},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"rene@crossfitcfd.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 1775646813\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitcfd\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitcfd\"}},{\"id_application\":\"56602674\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Laif Sports Xirivella (Valencia)\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/56602674\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Carrer dels Encordadors\",\"town\":\"Xirivella\",\"postal_code\":\"46950\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.4596581,\"longitude\":-0.4392285},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"laifsports@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"634 79 61 82\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"laifsports\",\"facebook\":\"laifsport\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2798\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Costa Blanca\",\"description\":\"ossfit Costa Blanca lo componen dos centros oficiales de CrossFit, situados desde 2014 en San Vicente del Raspeig,  junto a la Universidad, y un nuevo centro en pleno coraz\\u00f3n de la ciudad Alicante.\\nEl CrossFit es un tipo de entrenamiento compuesto por ejercicios funcionales, constantemente variados, ejecutados a alta intensidad. Es un programa de fuerza y acondicionamiento f\\u00edsico general, cuyo objetivo es incrementar el fitness. CrossFit se distingue por definir sus t\\u00e9rminos y por ser un programa observable, medible y repetible basado en datos donde podr\\u00e1s superarte y conseguir tus metas.\\n\\u00a1Prueba este nuevo deporte! \\u00a1Te sorprender\\u00e1!\\n\\n\\u00a1Ahora es el momento de cambiar tu vida!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2798\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2798\\/featured_images\\/53081050_2570180169676555_9095658306680127488_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2798\\/featured_images\\/53089489_2570180153009890_2442932451132047360_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2798\\/featured_images\\/53142799_2570180156343223_7851198361662128128_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2798\\/featured_images\\/CrossFit-Alicante-San-Vicente.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Zinc, 7C\",\"town\":\"Alicante\",\"postal_code\":\"03690\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":38.3900412,\"longitude\":-0.5131683},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitcostablanca.es\",\"phone\":\"699466345\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitcostablanca\",\"facebook\":\"@Crossfitcostablanca\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2636\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Ticinvm\",\"description\":\"CrossFit TICINVM \\u00e8 nato per riunire persone di tutte le et\\u00e0 in una grande famiglia, proponendo la propria idea di fitness e basandosi sempre su un comune denominatore: il divertimento.\\n\\nIl box, completamente all\\u2019avanguardia, \\u00e8 munito di tutte le attrezzature necessarie a far allenare contemporaneamente atleti di qualsiasi livello, esperienza, ed esigenza.\\nCrossFit TICINVM considera la forza, l\\u2019abilit\\u00e0 primaria sulla quale strutturare la preparazione di un atleta.\\n\\nAll\\u2019interno \\u00e8 allestito uno spazio dedicato al culto della forza stessa in collaborazione con STRONGFIRST, una delle migliori scuole in questo ambito.\\nIstruttori qualificati e certificati sono a disposizione per inserirti al meglio nella nostra grande famiglia e per aiutarti a superare i tuoi limiti.\\n\\nLe classi di allenamento sono strutturate per accogliere diversi livelli di preparazione in modo da, prima di tutto, assimilare le basi per poter partire in sicurezza, e, in un secondo momento, per dare la possibilit\\u00e0 di scelta all\\u2019atleta del livello di allenamento da raggiungere.\\n\\nQuesto per introdurre soprattutto i nuovi nel mondo del CrossFit.\\n\\nCrossFit TICINVM \\u00e8\\nFiducia \\u2022 Divertimento \\u2022 Comunit\\u00e0\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2636\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2636\\/featured_images\\/12079786_432116760314857_5959582786589935450_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2636\\/featured_images\\/12095028_432116750314858_4780687855912315717_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2636\\/featured_images\\/14953892_568329493360249_7439319016909256169_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2636\\/featured_images\\/15319275_581387252054473_8235717792250101818_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Brodolini, 7\",\"town\":\"Pavia\",\"postal_code\":\"27028\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.1654542,\"longitude\":9.1317822},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitticinvm.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 0382495330\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitTicinvm\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2671\",\"name\":\"AXT Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2671\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2671\\/featured_images\\/1526326570456.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2671\\/featured_images\\/Daniel_Coach_AXT_CrossFit_berlin.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Ehrenbergstra\\u00dfe 15\",\"town\":\"Berlin\",\"postal_code\":\"10245\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":52.5052942,\"longitude\":13.4501878},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"fabian@axtcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 16096691211\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"axtcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/axtcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3005\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Antequera\",\"description\":\"M\\u00e1s de 300 m\\u00b2 divididos en varias zonas de entrenamientos en Antequera. En el encontrar\\u00e1s personal altamente cualificado y entusiastas del CrossFit.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/14671255_1625045757792830_1684028226991088152_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/14925574_1627793994184673_1926123701172305300_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/17553646_1689495441347861_2930113362548624855_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/20374343_1741277842836287_334213829446753398_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/41067976_1941724369458299_8781557736186839040_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/41073952_1941723819458354_1459853456855531520_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3005\\/featured_images\\/43134393_1954792341484835_941357385610428416_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Avenida del Romeral 11, nave 6\",\"town\":\"Antequera\",\"postal_code\":\"29200\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.0239574,\"longitude\":-4.5383396},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitantequera@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"697634689\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitantequera\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitantequera\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2616\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Porta Ticinese\",\"description\":\"Significa entrare in una dimensione dove i tuoi sensi si attivano e i tuoi sistemi \\nsi smuovono producendo ormoni su ormoni, dove i tuoi muscoli sprigionano \\nforza ed energia sempre alla ricerca del grasso superfluo \\nper distruggerlo ed eliminarlo.\\n\\nSignifica dare una nuova linfa al tuo cervello e al tuo corpo.\\nImmagina di dover affrontare un avversario, qualsiasi esso sia, \\nle tue paure, le tue difficolt\\u00e0 e di poter le vincere.\\n\\nUn corpo fermo \\u00e8 un corpo senza vita.\\nTorniamo a essere quello che erano i nostri avi, \\ncoltivatori, cacciatori e guerrieri.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2616\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2616\\/featured_images\\/11051826_911488318927047_3935193444578352578_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2616\\/featured_images\\/11949309_914395961969616_8065203434688245396_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2616\\/featured_images\\/14856159_1161904510552092_414254504107532004_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2616\\/featured_images\\/1907491_876965912379288_773362646615151884_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Viale D\\u0027annunzio Gabriele, No 27\",\"town\":\"Milano\",\"postal_code\":\"20123\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.4530547,\"longitude\":9.1779677},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitportaticinese.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 02-39810857\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitportaticinese\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitportaticinese\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"39145489\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Athlevo CrossFit \",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/39145489\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Dusiplatz 8\",\"town\":\"Hamburg\",\"postal_code\":\"21035\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":53.5488282,\"longitude\":9.9871703},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"thorbenklper@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"040 182 96 720\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"@athlevocrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@athlevocrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_l