\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2969\\/featured_images\\/RedhawkCrossfit_web-96-400x600.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Magellanstra\\u00dfe 5\",\"town\":\"Wetter\",\"postal_code\":\"58300\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.3951633,\"longitude\":7.3350213},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"mail@redhawkcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 1704521176\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"redhawk_crossfit_kamen\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/redhawkcrossfit\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3049\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Mas LLui\",\"description\":\"BOX oficial de CrossFit emplazado en el barrio de Mas Llu\\u00ed, en Sant Feliu de Llobregat (500 m\\u00b2 en instalaciones). Nuestro centro dispone de 2 salas en las cuales se imparten las diferentes actividades que ofrecemos: Crossfit, Calistenia, Yoga Vinyasa, M\\u00e9todo Hipopresivo, Core, CrossKids y CF de Intensidad Moderada. An\\u00edmate a venir y reserva tu clase de prueba de forma gratuita.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3049\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3049\\/featured_images\\/40951_C2_0.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3049\\/featured_images\\/40951_PN_0.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3049\\/featured_images\\/40951_e3_0.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Passeig Comte de Vilardaga, 148\",\"town\":\"Sant Feliu de Llobregat\",\"postal_code\":\"08980\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.3876406,\"longitude\":2.0544603},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitmasllui.com\",\"phone\":\"932202898\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitmasllui\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFit-Mas-Llu\\u00ed-245953026119206\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2570\",\"name\":\"Box 00144\",\"description\":\"Il nostro scopo \\u00e8  di creare un programma di fitness ampio, generale e comprensivo. \\nCerchiamo ogni giorno  di costruire una programmazione per predisporre gli atleti a ogni eventualit\\u00e0 fisica e prepararli sia al previsto che all\\u2019imprevisto.\\nL\\u2019obiettivo del nostro Box per ottenere uno stato di fitness perfetto \\u00e8 \\u201ceseguire movimenti funzionali, costantemente variati, ad alta intensit\\u00e0\\u201d. I movimenti funzionali sono schemi motori universali per il coinvolgimento dei muscoli, si sviluppano dal \\u201ccore\\u201d alle estremit\\u00e0, sono movimenti composti e coinvolgono pi\\u00f9 articolazioni. \\nQuesti movimenti sono i pi\\u00f9 naturali, efficaci ed efficienti per spostare il proprio corpo e gli oggetti esterni. Ma nessun aspetto dei movimenti funzionali \\u00e8 pi\\u00f9 importante della loro capacit\\u00e0 di spostare grandi carichi su lunghe distanze e di farlo velocemente. \\nTutti insieme, questi tre attributi (carico, distanza e velocit\\u00e0) qualificano i movimenti funzionali come ideali per la produzione di grande potenza. \\nQuesto \\u00e8 il Box 00144\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2570\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2570\\/featured_images\\/45263602_613043602443700_3324643937980776448_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2570\\/featured_images\\/51052031_663335167414543_3164683065066782720_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2570\\/featured_images\\/51136484_663543067393753_3708330692430528512_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2570\\/featured_images\\/51178874_661820557566004_3513241720089214976_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Piazzale Marcellino Champagnat 2\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00144\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.822987,\"longitude\":12.4748826},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"sangabrielgymnasium@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 06 9020 1478\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/BoxFit00144\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2545\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Peak29\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/featured_images\\/48391221_2853488894676894_907195907227779072_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/featured_images\\/48416410_2854351331257317_3892891153741119488_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/featured_images\\/49325779_2869804589711991_5617812807941619712_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/featured_images\\/50675854_2923394524352997_6845890953123725312_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/featured_images\\/51977521_2967496989942750_5425098643277348864_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2545\\/featured_images\\/52001226_2966606140031835_8291336465443454976_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via G. de Vecchi Pieralice\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00165\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.9001811,\"longitude\":12.4422087},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitpeak29@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 392 4796755\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitPeak29\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"93141208\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Crosstraining Femmes\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/93141208\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"499 Av. de Dunkerque Lomme\",\"town\":\"Lille\",\"postal_code\":\"59160\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":5