s formados y avalados por CrossFit\\u00ae. Contamos con m\\u00e1s de 600 m2 de instalaciones especialmente preparadas para la pr\\u00e1ctica de la actividad y con equipo de la mejor calidad.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2883\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2883\\/featured_images\\/9b060a_80721701090f48228804949089ae3b7d_mv2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2883\\/featured_images\\/9b060a_c49a824d85de486ba00822b45e638496_mv2.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Av. Prado del Espino, 5\",\"town\":\"Boadilla del Monte\",\"postal_code\":\"28660\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":40.3933119,\"longitude\":-3.8508897},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@capsulecrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"915460682\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"capsulecrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@CapsuleCrossFit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2815\",\"name\":\"CrossFit 74800\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":null,\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2815\\/featured_images\\/41723600_2165824430299747_9050449751505371136_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2815\\/featured_images\\/41733091_2165606266988230_6574067876028743680_n%20%281%29.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2815\\/featured_images\\/47301801_2210742792474577_5748007538859704320_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2815\\/featured_images\\/50434573_2242830362599153_1542187443048939520_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"92 All\\u00e9e du M\\u00f4le\",\"town\":\"Amancy\",\"postal_code\":\"74800\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":46.0730386,\"longitude\":6.3159988},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@uni-corn-fitness.com\",\"phone\":\"09 81 85 92 75\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/unicornfitness74800\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"28772352\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Beat It!\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/28772352\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/28772352\\/featured_images\\/IMG-20220629-WA0014%281%29-01.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/28772352\\/featured_images\\/IMG-20220629-WA0023-01.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/28772352\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20220713_192036-01.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/28772352\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20220714_063214-01.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/28772352\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20220720_065736-01.jpeg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Tourist Street, 367\",\"town\":\"Saint Paul\\u0027s Bay\",\"postal_code\":\"SPB 1021\",\"country\":\"Malta\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":35.955608,\"longitude\":14.4224753},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"beatit@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"79897998\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"beatitgym\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3186\",\"name\":\"Crpssfit L\\u00fcbeck\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3186\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3186\\/featured_images\\/img-20171225-wa0005.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3186\\/featured_images\\/img-20180309-wa0003.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3186\\/featured_images\\/img_20180705_184519.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3186\\/featured_images\\/img_5149_2.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Hinter den Kirschkaten 83\",\"town\":\"L\\u00fcbeck\",\"postal_code\":\"23560\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":53.8423363,\"longitude\":10.6583809},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@worldofpunch.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 163 7331029\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2819\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Koroibos\",\"description\":\"El Box  se distribuye en dos espacios, uno de aproximadamente 200 metros cuadrados dedicado a la pr\\u00e1ctica del CrossFit, adem\\u00e1s de una zona \\u201cCardio\\u201d con bicicletas est\\u00e1ticas, bicicletas el\\u00edpticas, remos, cinta de correr, Skyerg, junto a una zona destinada a estiramientos para despu\\u00e9s del entrenamiento.\\n\\nEl box tienen capacidad y material para el entrenamiento de 16 atletas, aunque limitamos nuestras clases a 12 personas para dar un trato m\\u00e1s personalizado.\\n\\nNos encontramos en Lasarte-Oria con una muy buena comunicaci\\u00f3n tanto para el acceso a pie o en bicicleta, como en transporte p\\u00fablico o privado, disponiendo de amplias zonas para el aparcamiento.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2819\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2819\\/featured_images\\/50732263_2169444743094120_2509974897757782016_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2819\\/featured_images\\/Pablo-Db2-1028x450.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Paseo del C\\u00edrcuito\",\"town\":\"Lasarte-Oria\",\"postal_code\":\"20160\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.2568872,\"longitude\":-2.0209249},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitkoroibos.com\",\"phone\":\"653729501\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitkoroibos\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFitKoroibos\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3210\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Coblenz\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/featured_images\\/beweglichkeit2-791a51c7bef555aa9ef7e010d44660c8.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/featured_images\\/feld-vorne2-29330fadde8b7a748fc923493e58095c.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/featured_images\\/kraft2-612139f87d46fcbd9c237b95b5f0c3d6.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/featured_images\\/neuebox-f94db4f2d3c7254508d244a93ae62812.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/featured_images\\/seil0-b0762370ee02c71083f11ba90d014d21.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3210\\/featured_images\\/shop-e9d55c728f4a6cb1a11003388987d05f.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Am Auwaldsee 75\",\"town\":\"Ingolstadt\",\"postal_code\":\"85053\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.7550834,\"longitude\":11.472981},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"hallo@crossfitcoblenz.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 1774595299\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitcoblenz\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"73461776\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"DON ATHLETICS STUDIO\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/73461776\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/73461776\\/featured_images\\/Logo_Don.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Lot 15,3 Zone Centrale, Av Al Arz, Immeuble B, Magasin 2, Hay Riad\",\"town\":\"RABAT\",\"postal_code\":\"10100\",\"country\":\"MOROCCO\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":34.0083637,\"longitude\":-6.8538748},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@donstudio.ma\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"donathletics.studio\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2949\",\"name\":\"Versus Crossfit Getafe\",\"description\":\"M\\u00e1s de 800m2 di\\u00e1fanos con m\\u00e1s de 6m de altura, zona de entrenamiento al aire libre, zona aparcamiento. Adem\\u00e1s, podr\\u00e1s descansar, comer y beber en nuestra amplia y confortable \\u201cZona Community\\u201d. Tambi\\u00e9n disponemos de sala de fisioterapia o nutricionista para mejorar tu alimentaci\\u00f3n.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2949\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2949\\/featured_images\\/30415221_1790955217876280_7980935635613515776_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2949\\/featured_images\\/TXT-01-slide-nuevo-box.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Torneros, 19\",\"town\":\"Getafe\",\"postal_code\":\"28906\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":40.2970811,\"longitude\":-3.7744491},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"getafe@versuscrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"910849952\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitvsg\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitvsg\"}},{\"id_application\":\"22619510\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Countryside Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/22619510\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"15 bis Pl. des Francs\",\"town\":\"Vittel\",\"postal_code\":\"88800\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.1990026,\"longitude\":5.9523014},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"countryside_cf@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"06 79 07 17 70\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"countryside__crossfit__\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"97561107\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Millau\",\"description\":\"LA PHILOSOPHIE DE LA BOX\\nLA PROMOTION D\\u2019UN MODE DE VIE SAIN \\n\\nTOUTES LES ACTIVITES PROPOSEES, ET SERVICES SERONT TOURNES VERS LA PROMOTION D\\u2019UN MODE DE VIE SAIN, A BASE DE SPORT, D\\u2019ALIMENTATION NATURELLE. LA SANTE PASSERA AVANT LA PERFORMANCE. L\\u2019OBJECTIF EST DE SOLLICITER L\\u2019ENSEMBLE DU CORPS INTELLIGEMMENT AFIN AM\\u00c9LIORER DURABLEMENT LA QUALIT\\u00c9 DE VIE.\\n\\n\\nUN ESPRIT DE COMMUNAUT\\u00c9\\n\\nLE CROSSFIT EST UNE GRANDE COMMUNAUT\\u00c9, COMPOS\\u00c9E DE SALLES, QUI SONT CHACUNE DE PETITES COMMUNAUT\\u00c9S. CROSSFIT MILLAU A CETTE VOLONT\\u00c9 FAROUCHE DE CR\\u00c9ER UNE COMMUNAUT\\u00c9, UN ESPRIT DE GROUPE ET DE PARTAGER AVEC LES ADH\\u00c9RENTS UN MODE DE VIE ET DES VALEURS COMMUNES.\\n\\n\\nL\\u2019ADHERENT AU CENTRE DE L\\u2019ATTENTION \\n\\nCROSSFIT MILLAU NE SERA PAS UN CENTRE DE FITNESS AVEC UNE SIMPLE VOLONTE COMMERCIALE, MAIS PLUTOT UNE ECOLE OU TOUT UN CHACUN APPREND SUR LUI ET LES AUTRES. CROSSFIT MILLAU S\\u2019EFFORCERA DE CONTINUELLEMENT PROPOSER DE MEILLEURES PRESTATIONS AFIN DE SATISFAIRE SES ADHERENTS.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/97561107\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/97561107\\/featured_images\\/millau1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/97561107\\/featured_images\\/millau2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/97561107\\/featured_images\\/millau3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/97561107\\/featured_images\\/millau4.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"346 chemin de Sall\\u00e8les\",\"town\":\"Millau\",\"postal_code\":\"12100\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":44.100575,\"longitude\":3.077801},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@crossfitmillau.fr\",\"phone\":\"(+33) 0673477899\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitmillau\",\"facebook\":\"crossfitmillau\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2663\",\"name\":\"Seventh CrossFit Valpolicella\",\"description\":\"CrossFit \\u00e8 un programma e metodo di allenamento nato con l\\u2019obiettivo di sviluppare tutte le principali doti degli atleti moderni. Velocit\\u00e0, resistenza, potenza\\u2026 ma non solo. Un atleta di CrossFit incrementa, nel corso degli allenamenti, la propria flessibilit\\u00e0, reattivit\\u00e0, agilit\\u00e0 ed equilibrio.\\n\\nIl punto di forza di questo metodo \\u00e8 la multidisciplinariet\\u00e0: per sviluppare in maniera omogenea tutte queste doti, si eseguono allenamenti tipici del weightlifting (pesistica olimpica), oppure allenamenti di corsa o di ginnastica (anelli, parallele e sbarre\\u2026) e spesso, si eseguono allenamenti misti!\\n\\nPerch\\u00e9?\\nPerch\\u00e9 provare il CrossFit? Perch\\u00e9 da sempre guardiamo con ammirazione gli atleti di tutte le discipline pi\\u00f9 antiche. Chi non si \\u00e8 emozionato con le lunghissime corse di Gelindo Bordin? O con le perfette esecuzioni agli anelli di Yuri Chechi? Ricordate la potenza del pesista veronese Fausto Tosi alle olimpiadi di Seoul \\u201988? Prestazioni sportive che ci hanno emozionati tutti! Beh, perch\\u00e9 non \\u2026 provarle tutte?!? Chi si allena con noi pu\\u00f2 esercitarsi come un pesista con il bilanciere, o allenare le braccia e le spalle con una trazione agli anelli, o semplicemente una verticale sulle mani. Non manca poi la corsa e in estate anche il nuoto.\\n\\nNon esistono macchinari o infusi miracolosi per mettersi in forma e sentirsi bene a 360\\u00b0. La macchina migliore esiste gi\\u00e0 da millenni: siamo noi!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2663\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2663\\/featured_images\\/13119018_1283548341673172_5678060257001505030_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2663\\/featured_images\\/44508734_2338249849536344_2870791552651755520_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2663\\/featured_images\\/49015716_2434009779960350_5454043626180968448_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2663\\/featured_images\\/49730887_2445097295518265_5534866389476573184_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Lombardia, 17\",\"town\":\"Verona\",\"postal_code\":\"37012\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.4699819,\"longitude\":10.8968796},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@7thcrossfitvalpolicella.it\",\"phone\":\"+39 347 128 2217\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitverona\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"59642937\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Phoenix Training Box\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/59642937\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle del Pol. Ind. Berroa, 26\",\"town\":\"Aranguren\",\"postal_code\":\"31192\",\"country\":\"Espa\\u00f1a\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.771776,\"longitude\":-1.6249451},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@phoenixbox.es\",\"phone\":\"681196435\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"phoenixtrainingbox\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"98842834\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Valhalla Hybrid Training\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/98842834\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/98842834\\/featured_images\\/descarga.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"969 Avenues des vergers\",\"town\":\"Plan d\\u0027Orgon\",\"postal_code\":\"13750\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.824925,\"longitude\":5.0181152},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"corentin@lafrenchco.fr\",\"phone\":\"0660376724\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitdesponts\",\"facebook\":\"@lafrenchc0\"}},{\"id_application\":\"92966214\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"LAIF SPORTS CASTELL\\u00d3N\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":null,\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Carrer Peri 15 N\\u00fam. 4, 6\",\"town\":\"Castell\\u00f3 de la Plana\",\"postal_code\":\"12006\",\"country\":\"Espa\\u00f1a\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.9783685,\"longitude\":-0.0661004},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"laifsportscastellon@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"634796182\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3184\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Cologne\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-04%20um%2009.20.51.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-04%20um%2009.20.58.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-04%20um%2009.21.07.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-04%20um%2009.21.18.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-04%20um%2009.21.26.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3184\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-04%20um%2009.21.35.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Maarweg 132\",\"town\":\"K\\u00f6ln\",\"postal_code\":\"50825\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.9438967,\"longitude\":6.897093},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"INFO@CROSSFITCOLOGNE.COM\",\"phone\":\"+49 1775205619\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitcologne\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitcologne\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3078\",\"name\":\"T3 Crossfit\",\"description\":\"No queremos que s\\u00f3lo vengas a entrenar, queremos implicarnos en tu aprendizaje y acompa\\u00f1arte en todas las etapas.\\nPor eso somos la primera escuela de Crossfit en Valencia.\\nEn T3Crossfit queremos que progreses de forma segura, por lo que evaluaremos tu rendimiento y te llevaremos a lo m\\u00e1s alto, de la manera m\\u00e1s eficaz. No ser\\u00e1 f\\u00e1cil, ni r\\u00e1pido, pero merecer\\u00e1 la pena.\\nNos importa tu salud, por eso, antes de empezar a entrenar, todos nuestros atletas tienen la opci\\u00f3n de una evaluaci\\u00f3n previa completa por parte de nuestro equipo de fisioterapia, de manera gratuita.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3078\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3078\\/featured_images\\/55450485_275536133381627_7438027979575263232_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3078\\/featured_images\\/60548638_304907240444516_3538178003857047552_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pol. Industrial L\\u00b4horta Vella Calle 1, 73\",\"town\":\"Betera\",\"postal_code\":\"46117\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.5865269,\"longitude\":-0.44604},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@t3crossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"686 820 274\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"t3crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@t3crossfitvlc\"}},{\"id_application\":\"51605765\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit The Crypt\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/51605765\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"8, Avenue de B\\u00e2le\",\"town\":\"Bruxelles\",\"postal_code\":\"1140\",\"country\":\"Belgium\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.8503396,\"longitude\":4.3517103},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"cf_thecrypt@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"0032473492730\\t\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitthecrypt\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"71679804\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Crossfit Orion\",\"descr