red_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-04-15%20um%2012.37.56.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Steilshooper Str. 35,\",\"town\":\"Hamburg\",\"postal_code\":\"22305\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":53.5860877,\"longitude\":10.0460884},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"michael@crossfithh.de\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2786\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Cordoba\",\"description\":\"BOX OFICIAL CROSSFIT EN C\\u00d3RDOBA CAPITAL\\nwww.crossfitcordoba.es\\ninfo@crossfitcordoba.es\\nTrainers: Laura Fern\\u00e1ndez C\\u00e1ceres y Fran Castro Valera\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2786\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2786\\/featured_images\\/55450413_2231203843660136_3541120700699901952_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2786\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-cordoba-1512.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Acera Fuente de la Salud, Nave 8\",\"town\":\"C\\u00f3rdoba\",\"postal_code\":\"14006\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.9015822,\"longitude\":-4.7758597},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitcordoba.es\",\"phone\":\"691 43 93 29\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitcordoba\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitcordoba Inicio\"}},{\"id_application\":\"94710817\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"The Lab\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/94710817\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Chau. d\\u0027Alsemberg 342\",\"town\":\"Forest\",\"postal_code\":\"1190\",\"country\":\"Belgium\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.816183,\"longitude\":4.3402706},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"secretariat@thelab.dance\",\"phone\":\"02 345 05 47\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"the_lab_malaika\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/thelabmalaika\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3168\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Grafenw\\u00f6hr\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3168\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Die\\u00dffurter Str. 18\",\"town\":\"Grafenw\\u00f6hr\",\"postal_code\":\"92655\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.7175974,\"longitude\":11.9137099},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitgrafenwoehr.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 1704534572\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitGraf\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2993\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Kaiserslautern\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2993\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2993\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-04%20um%2009.41.07.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2993\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-04%20um%2009.41.27.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2993\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-04%20um%2009.41.43.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Oscar-Walcker-Str 26\",\"town\":\"Ludwigsburg\",\"postal_code\":\"71636\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.8878485,\"longitude\":9.1746787},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitkaiserslautern.com\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossfitKaiserslautern\\/posts\\/2234558503464134\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2832\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Blue Wolf\",\"description\":\"Nuestro compromiso para con nuestros clientes es ofrecer nuestra mejor versi\\u00f3n y ayudar a todas y cada una de las personas, independientemente de su condici\\u00f3n f\\u00edsica, a mejorar su calidad de vida. Nuestra programaci\\u00f3n respeta 100% la metodolog\\u00eda que CrossFit nos aporta. No existe un programa de fitness y acondicionamiento que funcione con una mayor diversidad de herramientas, modalidades y ejercicios.\\n\\nSeguridad, eficacia y eficiencia, son los pilares fundamentales en los que se centra nuestro programa. El trabajo de t\\u00e9cnica es primordial, la intensidad se maneja de acuerdo a las condiciones f\\u00edsicas de cada persona y nos movemos en unos patrones de cargas que aportan la estimulaci\\u00f3n necesaria a cada individuo. Esta noci\\u00f3n tiene como principio b\\u00e1sico mantener intacta la motivaci\\u00f3n de nuestros clientes a largo plazo.\\n\\nNo importa cual sea tu edad, forma f\\u00edsica o experiencia. T\\u00fa decides el nivel de esfuerzo e intensidad al que tu cuerpo es capaz de trabajar. Aumentamos la competencia de una persona en todas las tareas f\\u00edsicas, adaptadas tanto al deporte como a la vida cotidiana. En general buscamos una mejor calidad de vida en todos los aspectos.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2832\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2832\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault%20%281%29.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2832\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault%20%282%29.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2832\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Herrer\\u00edas, 2. Pol\\u00edgono Industrial Canastell\",\"town\":\"San Vicente del Raspeig\",\"postal_code\":\"03690\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":38.4021897,\"longitude\":-0.5416717},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitbluewolf.com\",\"phone\":\"966103892\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitbluewolf\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFit-BlueWolf-531425570294521\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2876\",\"name\":\"Golden Health Box\",\"description\":\"Un estudio deportivo en el Paseo de la Castellana (Madrid) en el que entrenar cuerpo y mente para mejorar tu calidad de vida a trav\\u00e9s de disciplinas como Boxeo, CrossFit, Yoga o entrenamientos personales, que lograr\\u00e1n cambiar tus h\\u00e1bitos de vida.\\n\\nUn  concepto que a\\u00fana las mejores herramientas y sistemas de entrenamiento, todos los avances en materia nutricional y las mejores terapias. El resultado: un centro integral para cuidarse y sentirse bien por dentro y por fuera en un espacio \\u00fanico en el centro de Madrid.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2876\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2876\\/featured_images\\/Box-CrossFit-Castellana.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2876\\/featured_images\\/recepcion-golden-health-box.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2876\\/featured_images\\/venueHome_1024x576_Golden4_1552034778437041_admin.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Paseo de la Castellana, 56\",\"town\":\"Madrid\",\"postal_code\":\"28046\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":40.4361433,\"longitude\":-3.6909359},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"atecionalcliente@goldenhealthbox.com\",\"phone\":\"910561932\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"goldenhealthboxcenter\",\"facebook\":\"@goldenhealthbox\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3209\",\"name\":\"Powerhouse\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3209\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3209\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-11%20um%2010.00.05.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3209\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-07-11%20um%2010.00.18.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Antoniusstra\\u00dfe 11\",\"town\":\"Koblenz\",\"post