ct_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfittrier@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"0174 9511223\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"87457335\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Catalaunes\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/87457335\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/87457335\\/featured_images\\/Logo%20Catalaunes%20modifi%C3%A9-1.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"5 ZAC Les Escarnoti\\u00e8res, 5 Rue Blaise Pascal\",\"town\":\"Ch\\u00e2lons-en-Champagne\",\"postal_code\":\"51000\",\"country\":\"france\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.956682,\"longitude\":4.363073},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"cfcatalunes@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"06 19 58 57 62\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit.catalaunes\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3007\",\"name\":\"Wild Soul Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3007\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3007\\/featured_images\\/40606993_715278308804812_4968556985650774016_n-300x225.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3007\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pol\\u00edgono El Pino II, Calle Azor, 6\",\"town\":\"San Javier\",\"postal_code\":\"30730\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.8132259,\"longitude\":-0.8593415},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@wildsoulcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"645 29 10 20\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"wildsoulcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@wildsoulcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2660\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Castiglione delle Stiviere\",\"description\":\"Non \\u00e8 mai troppo tardi per cambiare le cose e decidere di essere la persona che desideri.\\n\\nIl tempo non \\u00e8 nostro nemico, si \\u00e8 sempre in tempo per capire i propri errori e decidere di cambiare, di vivere la vita al meglio.\\n\\n \\n\\n\\u201cSpero che tu viva tutto al meglio\\n\\nSpero che tu possa vedere cose sorprendenti\\n\\nSpero che tu possa avere emozioni sempre nuove\\n\\nSpero che tu possa incontrare persone con diversi punti di vista\\n\\nSpero che tu possa essere orgoglioso della tua vita\\n\\nE se ti accorgi di non esserlo, spero tu trovi la forza di ricominciare da zero\\u201d\\n\\n \\n\\n\\u201cQuesto \\u00e8 quello in cui crediamo, questa \\u00e8 la nostra mentalit\\u00e0.\\nL\\u2019importante nella vita \\u00e8 cercare di migliorarsi sempre nel fisico come nelle relazioni con le persone e non importa il tempo che ci si impiega, perch\\u00e9 quel tempo rappresenta la strada che bisogna percorrere se si vuole arrivare al successo.\\u201d\\n\\n \\n\\nDott. Cristian Dal Lago\\nCrossFit Castiglione Head Coach\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2660\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2660\\/featured_images\\/26804878_1744625722268195_6631309891767271110_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2660\\/featured_images\\/29314881_1810765602320873_6531530176331776000_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2660\\/featured_images\\/51931653_2268701033193992_7315516597257371648_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2660\\/featured_images\\/54727832_2331001473630614_419345591575773184_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Toscanini, 41\",\"town\":\"Mantova\",\"postal_code\":\"46043\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.3925793,\"longitude\":10.4699862},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitcastiglionedellestiviere.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 0376 671986\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitcastiglione\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3067\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Kampfgeist\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3067\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3067\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20180720_075538.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3067\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20180720_075541.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3067\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20180720_075546.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3067\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20180720_075550.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3067\\/featured_images\\/IMG_20180720_075601.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Hilpertstra\\u00dfe 31\",\"town\":\"Darmstadt\",\"postal_code\":\"64295\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.8621234,\"longitude\":8.6203913},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfit-kampfgeist.de\",\"phone\":\"004906151 9063388\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit.kampfgeist\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit.Kampfgeist\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2887\",\"name\":\"Crossfit \\u00edcaro\",\"description\":\"Las necesidades de cada persona se diferencian en grado de intensidad, no en el tipo de entrenamiento. Creemos que cada persona es diferente, pero que todos nos beneficiamos de movimientos funcionales, variados constantemente. Aspiramos a mejorar el movimiento humano y la salud desde la base de una nutrici\\u00f3n adecuada y una t\\u00e9cnica insuperable. Queremos preparar a nuestros miembros para cualquier eventualidad. Juntos, podemos ayudarte a encontrar tu mejor versi\\u00f3n\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2887\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2887\\/featured_images\\/38119961_897496270461565_8649260111971221504_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2887\\/featured_images\\/98246f9361018143a41e66f5573c5b2a.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Poligono El Juncal, barrio 7, 1\",\"town\":\"Trapagaran\",\"postal_code\":\"48510\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.2927563,\"longitude\":-3.0155233},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfiticaro.com\",\"phone\":\"946444026 \\/656845606\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfiticaro\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfiticaro\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2775\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Gasteiz\",\"description\":\"CROSSFIT GASTEIZ \\nPrimer Box oficial de Crossfit en la ciudad de Vitoria - Gasteiz.\\nDisfruta de 500 m2 con los mejores coach, materiales y equipaci\\u00f3n.\\n\\nCrossfit Gasteiz es el primer y \\u00fanico Box oficial de Crossfit en la ciudad de Vitoria - Gasteiz\\n500 m2 con el mejor material y equipaci\\u00f3n.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2775\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2775\\/featured_images\\/disponible.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2775\\/featured_images\\/murph.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2775\\/featured_images\\/wod-14.10.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/ Portal de Legutiano, 5\",\"town\":\"Vitoria- Gasteiz\",\"postal_code\":\"01002\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.8534863,\"longitude\":-2.67052},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitgasteiz@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"945774978\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Gasteiz-386917001377241\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"66753357\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"A\\u0026M Trainers\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/66753357\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Gloria, 1\",\"town\":\"Sanl\\u00facar la Mayor\",\"postal_code\":\"41800\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.3906544,\"longitude\":-6.2054624},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"a\\u0026mtrainers@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"+34 605 39 79 84\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"65499370\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Coahoma x Tahka\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/65499370\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"8 RUE DES GRIVES\",\"town\":\"Villers-sur-Mer\",\"postal_code\":\"14640\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.321744,\"longitude\":-0.005321},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"vlad@crossfit-coahoma.fr\",\"phone\":\"02.31.14.09.95\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_coahoma\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Coahoma-319803178747010\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2825\",\"name\":\"Crossfit VLC\",\"description\":\"En CrossFit VLC nos hemos quedado m\\u00e1s anchos que largos! equipando un box de m\\u00e1s de 1500 m2 con todo el material e instalaciones necesarios para que entrenes sin esperas y disfrutes de un entrenamiento con material profesional.\\n\\n \\n\\nUbicado en la ciudad de Valencia, con unas amplias instalaciones, BOX 100% CLIMATIZADO, diferentes  zonas de entrenamiento, como lo son, CrossFit Endurance, Strenght, CrossRehab e incluso una gran zona al aire libre, junto con unos alrededores \\u00f3ptimos para el deporte como el parque de Cabecera y el antiguo cauce del R\\u00edo de Valencia, hemos planteado y pensado todo para que \\u00e9sta sea una verdadera revoluci\\u00f3n del fitness.\\n\\n \\n\\nContar\\u00e1s con un amplio box de CrossFit con todo tipo de material para entrenamiento funcional, ejercicios gimn\\u00e1sticos, halterofilia, strongman, Concept Rowers y Skiergs, Assault Air Bikes, equipamiento de Rogue Fitness... todo ello en un amplio espacio para entrenar sin agobios.\\n\\n \\n\\nDispondr\\u00e1s de asesoramiento nutricional y de un programa espec\\u00edfico para reactivar y mejorar tu movilidad en nuestra sala de mobility\\/rehabilitaci\\u00f3n \\u0022CrossRehab\\u0022.\\n\\n \\n\\nY todo esto no significa nada sin t\\u00ed,  que constituyes junto a nosotros y el resto de atletas el factor humano\\n\\u00a1En CrossFit VLC todos sumamos y trabajamos d\\u00eda a d\\u00eda para mejorar como atletas y como personas!\\n\\u00a1Te esperamos!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2825\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2825\\/featured_images\\/20150423234335022948_crossfit-vlc-1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2825\\/featured_images\\/20150423234335022948_crossfit-vlc-2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2825\\/featured_images\\/Ci-RKQvXIAE-t6e.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2825\\/featured_images\\/original_2032x1143_52598304_1525806867550103_4045830498155495424_o_1555329605764721_admin.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Valle de la Ballestera n\\u00ba62\",\"town\":\"Valencia\",\"postal_code\":\"46015\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.4786771,\"longitude\":-0.4066007},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitvlc.com\",\"phone\":\"633462024\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitvlc\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFitvlc\"}},{\"id_application\":\"22287773\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Illib\\u00e9ris\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/22287773\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/22287773\\/featured_images\\/1.png\",\"https:\\