2019-04-08%20um%2011.15.26.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2681\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-04-08%20um%2011.15.42.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Jeanne-Mammen-Bogen 578-579\",\"town\":\"Berlin\",\"postal_code\":\"10623\",\"country\":\"Deustchland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":52.5047135,\"longitude\":13.3215179},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"hello@escapistcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 30-521 02 388\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"escapistcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/escapistcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2654\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Air Mantova\",\"description\":\"\\u0022In genere i migliori atleti del mondo sono minimalisti quando si tratta della loro formazione. Lavorano duramente e velocemente con pochi esercizi. Essi padroneggiano i fondamenti e lavorano con loro per anni. Questo \\u00e8 il segreto che nessuno vuole sentire. \\u0022 \\n- Greg Glassman, fondatore di CrossFit\\n\\nCrossFit \\u00e8 un programma di allenamento ampio, che ha come obbiettivo quello di migliorare e ottimizzare le competenze psicofisiche di ogni individuo.\\nCi\\u00f2 vuol dire che tutti possono praticare CrossFit: dall\\u2019atleta professionista, fino ad arrivare a persone anziane. \\nQuesto significa che un professionista e una persona \\u201cnormale\\u201d potrebbero allenarsi contemporaneamente, le loro esigenze non sono diverse, non differiscono per tipo, ma solo per livello, carico e intensit\\u00e0\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2654\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2654\\/featured_images\\/44060669_326724341437857_6466704607140642816_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2654\\/featured_images\\/44792281_332687457508212_559082910896881664_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2654\\/featured_images\\/44950363_334349744008650_5411557938537955328_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2654\\/featured_images\\/48053428_358284124948545_956527837165125632_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Cremona 27b\",\"town\":\"Mantova\",\"postal_code\":\"46100\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.1558447,\"longitude\":10.7649393},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitair.com\",\"phone\":\"+393295910424\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_air_mantova\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitair\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"77154699\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"APTAVITA\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/77154699\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/77154699\\/featured_images\\/Apta%20Vita%20Salle.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/77154699\\/featured_images\\/Apta%20Vita%20salle%202.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"3 Rue Michel Carr\\u00e9\",\"town\":\"Cabestany\",\"postal_code\":\"66330\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.688241,\"longitude\":2.9209116},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@aptavita.fr\",\"phone\":\"0615653031\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"aptavita_deviensmeilleur\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/aptavita.pt\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2631\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Lario\",\"description\":\"SIAMO IL PRIMO E UNICO BOX UFFICIALE DI CROSSFIT A COMO\\nNon siamo la solita palestra con venditori, massaggiatrici e televisori.\\nSiamo il primo e unico box uf\\ufb01ciale di solo CrossFit a Como.\\nVieni a provare la differenza, scopri l\\u2019allenamento che funziona davvero.\\nMolte palestre provano a imitare il nostro programma di allenamento ma soltanto nei box affiliati puoi trovare il CrossFit originale.\\n\\nNon ti accontentare delle imitazioni, diffida di chi improvvisa e allenati con chi ti pu\\u00f2 garantire l\\u2019efficacia e la sicurezza del vero CrossFit.\\nSiamo certificati CrossFit L1 Trainer Course, CrossFit L2 Coach Prep Course, Official Judge, Certificazione CrossFit Kids, Scaling Certificate e Weightlifting Certificate.\\nCrossFit \\u00e8 un marchio registrato da CrossFit Inc. USA. \\u00c8 concesso in esclusiva agli affiliati certificati.\\nDI NOI, TI PUOI FIDARE!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/12494688_1116530825053253_9076872329157935765_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/12924347_1116534631719539_2309201999181901702_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/19983285_1864743816898613_5089362331715967003_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/27021281_1864745226898472_5335493823981869180_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/27164523_1864743970231931_2976768665962431147_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/27173785_1864746153565046_798199597845813424_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2631\\/featured_images\\/41963370_2172055826167409_8920762582642458624_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Bonifacio da Modena, 1\",\"town\":\"Como\",\"postal_code\":\"22100\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.7863959,\"longitude\":9.0602228},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitlario.it\",\"phone\":\"+39 342 9962001\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitlario\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitlario\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"28419324\",\"id_lea