o un patio exterior de m\\u00e1s de 300m2 (adicionales), \\nel cual nos permite realizar multitud de entrenos y din\\u00e1micas en el exterior.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2886\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2886\\/featured_images\\/13350422-567669323436534-499133340097815206-o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2886\\/featured_images\\/23_CRFC_2018.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2886\\/featured_images\\/dsc-0496.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2886\\/featured_images\\/dsc-9585.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Malag\\u00f3n, 16\",\"town\":\"Ciudad Real\",\"postal_code\":\"13005\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":38.9746466,\"longitude\":-3.9362941},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitciudadreal.com\",\"phone\":\"926048795\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_ciudad_real\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossfitCiudadReal\"}},{\"id_application\":\"68513465\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"L\\u0027arene Crossfit Gradignan\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/68513465\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"37 ALLEE DE MEGEVIE\",\"town\":\"GRADIGNAN\",\"postal_code\":\"33170\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":44.77755577,\"longitude\":-0.63866454},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"gradignan@larenecrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"06 29 36 89 76\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"larenecrossfit_gradignan\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":\"14746403\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Hope\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/14746403\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/14746403\\/featured_images\\/Logo_CrossFit_Hope%20%281%29.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"225 boulevard de Westphalie\",\"town\":\"BARENTIN\",\"postal_code\":\"76360\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.5323982,\"longitude\":0.964756},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@crossfithope.fr\",\"phone\":\"0640084939\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit.hope\",\"facebook\":\"crossfit hope\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2790\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Elviria\",\"description\":\"At CrossFit Elviria we believe it is much more than just a place to improve fitness. Our goal is to create a community: the CrossFit community. Not only will our environment be most welcoming, but it will be challenging - physically and mentally - as well.\\n\\nEveryone who walks into our box will have an individual goal from day one, no matter what that goal may be. You may want to excel in competition or just get into better \\u201cshape\\u201d. Others of you may have been talked into membership by a friend and have no idea why you are here or what your goal is. We will help you set one. Whatever the reason, we will look after you all in exactly the same way to help you find and achieve your personal goal.\\n\\nWe welcome people of all different fitness abilities, genders, weights and ages. We can scale any workout to any individual. We strive to bring out the best in every person who walks through our door and help them achieve their own fitness goals.\\n\\nOur coaches are all CrossFit Level One Trainers and offer a comprehensive, professional and caring approach to your health and fitness goals.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2790\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2790\\/featured_images\\/1234136_737300772981387_1598969864_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2790\\/featured_images\\/IMG_5546.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2790\\/featured_images\\/IMG_5935.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Poligono Industrial Elviria, nave 38\",\"town\":\"Marbella\",\"postal_code\":\"29600\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":36.4957311,\"longitude\":-4.7683261},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"karl@crossfitelviria.com\",\"phone\":\"663 02 57 24\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitelviria\",\"facebook\":\"@Crossfitelviria\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3071\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Anteus\",\"description\":\"\\u00bfQuieres mejorar tu condici\\u00f3n f\\u00edsica y sentirte bien con tu cuerpo? \\n\\nEn el Gimnasio Anteus tenemos 300 metros disponibles para ti, totalmente dedicados al deportes con equipamiento realmente eficaz. Contamos con unas amplias instalaciones en las que puedes disfrutar de una gran variedad de actividades divertidas con las que ponerte en forma y pasarlo bien.\\n\\nTambi\\u00e9n contamos con una sala para el entrenamiento de musculaci\\u00f3n y fuerza y con unos vestuarios totalmente equipados. Nuestra atenci\\u00f3n es totalmente individualizada, nos centramos en las personas y en sus necesidades y ponemos a tu disposici\\u00f3n un servicio de entrenamiento personalizado con los mejores profesionales. \\n\\nPonemos a tu disposici\\u00f3n todo tipo de clases colectivas como fitness, aerobic, cardiobox, cross training, ciclo indoor, pilates, artes marciales y mucho m\\u00e1s, con grupos reducidos y adaptadas a los objetivos que est\\u00e1s buscando.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3071\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3071\\/featured_images\\/2aea579182bd43c3ab8dde5a193b9bef.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3071\\/featured_images\\/48411772_1759751190803588_1005437133730611200_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3071\\/featured_images\\/de840bf8da204cfdb3d583cb91a4dcf4.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle de la Isla de Arosa, 27 posterior\",\"town\":\"Madrid\",\"postal_code\":\"28035\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":40.4801786,\"longitude\":-3.7184777},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@gimnasioanteus.es\",\"phone\":\"917308742\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitanteus\",\"facebook\":\"@gimnasio.anteus\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2846\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Roquetas\",\"description\":\"CrossFit ROQUETAS se funda en el a\\u00f1o 2015 de la mano de dos entrenadores certificados por CrossFit, poniendo todo su esfuerzo e ilusi\\u00f3n en ofrecer este m\\u00e9todo de entrenamiento por primera vez en Roquetas de Mar.\\n\\nDesde tu primer d\\u00eda en el box, recibir\\u00e1s una atenci\\u00f3n personalizada en todo momento:\\n\\nvaloraci\\u00f3n de la condici\\u00f3n f\\u00edsica\\nentrevista de evaluaci\\u00f3n de objetivos\\nasesoramiento en nutrici\\u00f3n y recuperaci\\u00f3n\\nprogramaci\\u00f3n individual del entrenamiento de la fuerza\\nreadaptaci\\u00f3n y recuperaci\\u00f3n funcional de lesiones y patolog\\u00edas\\npreparaci\\u00f3n f\\u00edsica espec\\u00edfica de deportes individuales y colectivos\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2846\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2846\\/featured_images\\/box_banner_02.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2846\\/featured_images\\/para-quien-es1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2846\\/featured_images\\/que-es.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Pintores, 18\",\"town\":\"Roquetas de Mar\",\"postal_code\":\"04740\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":36.7838119,\"longitude\":-2.6079823},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitroquetas.com\",\"phone\":\"630227376\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitroquetas\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2884\",\"name\":\"Reebok Crossfit BCN\",\"description\":\"Disfruta de un entrenamiento nuevo y distinto todos los d\\u00edas con el m\\u00e9todo CrossFit. Para que te sea m\\u00e1s f\\u00e1cil, disponemos de tres boxes m\\u00e1s ubicados en Barcelona, Mollet del Vall\\u00e9s y Badalona.\\n\\n\\u00a1Visita nuestros otros boxes!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2884\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2884\\/featured_images\\/29187139_1550165065032865_3798532448824852480_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2884\\/featured_images\\/N9ahqcKQrDvi.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2884\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-barcelona-reebok-slider--768x232.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Ribes 25 local\",\"town\":\"Barelona\",\"postal_code\":\"08013\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.3946404,\"longitude\":2.1794462},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@reebokcrossfitbcn.com\",\"phone\":\"619663502\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"reebokcrossfitbcn\",\"facebook\":\"@reebokcrossfitbcn\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2856\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Basauri\",\"description\":\"En todos nuestros entrenamientos vamos a implicar a diferentes partes de nuestro cuerpo y a una intensidad un poco m\\u00e1s elevada de lo habitual, vamos a buscar siempre dar un PLUS. El l\\u00edmite y la intensidad los pone cada uno y nosotros te ayudaremos a conseguir todos tus objetivos haci\\u00e9ndolo f\\u00e1cil y divertido\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2856\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2856\\/featured_images\\/13407103_1604391529873325_8983435812549887996_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\