https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/75096894\\/featured_images\\/IMG_5272.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/75096894\\/featured_images\\/IMG_5276.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/75096894\\/featured_images\\/Logo-Instagram.PNG\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Chemin de l\\u2019Etang Long\",\"town\":\"Pia\",\"postal_code\":\"66380\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.7421811,\"longitude\":2.8962496},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@crossfit-polygone.com\",\"phone\":\"0634172218 - 0664683272\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_polygone\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/pages\\/CrossFit-Polygone\\/1466548670336920?fref=ts\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3002\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Bambule\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3002\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3002\\/featured_images\\/Ingo-Technik-300x200.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3002\\/featured_images\\/Wall-Balls-Gruppe-300x200.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Chemnitzer Stra\\u00dfe 105\",\"town\":\"Chemnitz\",\"postal_code\":\"09224\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.8099631,\"longitude\":12.7813529},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitbambule.com\",\"phone\":\"+49 1623846344\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2634\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Barbell Bridge\",\"description\":\"COME INIZIARE\\n\\nContattaci telefonicamente o compila il form adiacente per fissare un appuntamento per un Free Trial.\\n\\nRicordati di Inserire il numero del FREE TRIAL di tuo interesse, sarai ricontattato dai nostri coaches.\\n\\n \\n\\nUn FREE TRIAL, o classe introduttiva gratuita, \\u00e8 il primo passo per decidere se CrossFit Barbell Bridge \\u00e8 ci\\u00f2 che stai cercando! Non devi essere in forma per provare; l\\u2019allenamento verr\\u00e0 scalato e adattato ad ogni livello. Devi solo presentarti! \\u00c8 necessario un normale abbigliamento da fitness e dell\\u2019acqua da bere durante e dopo la classe. Ci sono anche un bar e un distributore automtico all\\u2019interno della struttura. Inoltre potrai usufruire degli spogliatoi e docce all\\u2019inizio e alla fine del tuo allenamento.\\n\\n\\nDopo aver provato, se vuoi continuare con noi, dovrai iscriverti. Un assistente si occuper\\u00e0 di te. Scoprirai che siamo il CrossFit box con il miglior abbonamento e il massimo valore\\n\\n3\\nON RAMP\\n\\nIl tuo percorso da atleta comincia qui. Una volta iscritto, frequenterai il programma On Ramp di CrossFit Barbell Bridge che \\u00e8 studiato per introdurti passo per passo ai movimenti fondamentali che incontrerai nel tuo allenamento. Si tratta di 8 ore distribuite lungo 4 settimane. Ti preparer\\u00e0 ad eseguire in sicurezza i principali esercizi di ginnastica, sollevamento pesi e ti indicher\\u00e0 i percorsi di miglioramento degli stessi. Inoltre si affronteranno anche gli elementi base di nutrizione che ti aiuteranno nel tuo viaggio per raggiungere i tuoi obiettivi.\\n\\n\\nBUTTATI NELLE CLASSI\\n\\nUna volta frequentato il corso On Ramp, contatta la Reception e ti verranno dati il Login e la Password necessari per accedere al sistema di prenotazione e cos\\u00ec potrai partecipare alle classi che terranno un massimo di 16 persone. Vedrai che anche i Wod regolari saranno scalati e adattati in modo da essere assolutamente alla tua portata.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2634\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2634\\/featured_images\\/17157690_1224874140960458_7119415943018997932_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2634\\/featured_images\\/36762009_1701395753308292_709000853192704000_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2634\\/featured_images\\/37818613_1729727233808477_575753392664608768_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2634\\/featured_images\\/39963744_1779830895464777_7573269301361115136_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2634\\/featured_images\\/49343125_1933691036745428_1606794505778888704_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Cassani 7\",\"town\":\"Pavia\",\"postal_code\":\"27100\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.2029226,\"longitude\":9.1711718},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitbarbellbridge.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 0382 163 2239\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitBarbellBridgePV\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3012\",\"name\":\"Trave Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3012\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3012\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-05%20um%2009.51.05.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3012\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-05%20um%2009.51.16.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3012\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-05%20um%2009.51.28.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3012\\/featured_images\\/Bildschirmfoto%202019-06-05%20um%2009.51.35.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Posener Str. 7\",\"town\":\"L\\u00fcbeck\",\"postal_code\":\"23554\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":53.8868207,\"longitude\":10.6867143},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@trave-crossfit.de\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/travecrossfit\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"24936059\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit On The Road\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/24936059\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Beertsestraat 84\",\"town\":\"Halle\",\"postal_code\":\"1500\",\"country\":\"Belgium\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":50.732187,\"longitude\":4.228798},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"reservations@crossfitontheroad.be\",\"phone\":\"0476 39 50 10\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitontheroadbelgium\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitOnTheRoadBelgium\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2958\",\"name\":\"Dockyardcrossfit\",\"description\":\"Encontrar\\u00e1s tarifas que se ajustan a tus necesidades. Curso de fundamentos para que no te pierdas las bases del CrossFit. Ac\\u00e9rcate y descubre lo que te ofrecemos.\\nMucho m\\u00e1s que sesiones de entrenamientos, en Dockyard CrossFit queremos que te sientas parte de algo grande. Date la oportunidad de ser m\\u00e1s fuerte que nunca. \\u00abStronger Than Ever\\u00bb.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2958\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2958\\/featured_images\\/53324226_952768578260722_3277269572532568064_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Arrastre, 15\",\"town\":\"Huelva\",\"postal_code\":\"21002\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.2689122,\"longitude\":-6.9630233},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@dockyardcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"617185246\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"dockyard_crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@dockyardcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":\"84954943\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Aleki\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/84954943\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"1 place du champ de foire\",\"town\":\"Sauvagnon\",\"postal_code\":\"64230\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3989838,\"longitude\":-0.3887839},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@aleki.fr\",\"phone\":\"06.85.96.21.50\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"aleki_sauvagnon\",\"facebook\":\"alekisauvagnon\"}},{\"id_application\":\"63480227\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Crossfit Haan\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/63480227\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/63480227\\/featured_images\\/662f49f66d910.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/63480227\\/featured_images\\/662f49fa1b42a.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/63480227\\/featured_images\\/662f49fb12208.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/63480227\\/featured_images\\/662f49fc00174.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/63480227\\/featured_images\\/662f49fde56a6.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/63480227\\/featured_images\\/662f49feb627d.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Thunbuschstra\\u00dfe 10\",\"town\":\"Haan\",\"postal_code\":\"42781\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.2159383,\"longitude\":7.0086199},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfithaan@nubapp-clients.com\",\"phone\":\"15758394530\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfithaan\",\"facebook\":\"\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2919\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Teide\",\"description\":\"\\u00bfTe aburre tu gimnasio y quieres sentirte motivado? Puede asustar pero cuando conoces algo mas sobre CrossFit sentir\\u00e1s atracci\\u00f3n a seguir super\\u00e1ndote a ti mismo. Los que ya lo practican dicen que es el ejercicio m\\u00e1s completo y que es el cambio a un estilo de vida que te har\\u00e1 sentir m\\u00e1s en forma que nunca. CrossFit Teide es tu centro de CrossFit en el Sur de Tenerife.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2919\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2919\\/featured_images\\/Crossfit-Teide-3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2919\\/featured_images\\/box1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2919\\/featured_images\\/box3.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2919\\/featured_images\\/box4.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"C\\/Plasencia n\\u00ba152\",\"town\":\"Santa Cruz de Tenerife\",\"postal_code\":\"38639\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":28.052449,\"longitude\":-16.6245317},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitteide.com\",\"phone\":\"654.606.705\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitteide\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfiteide\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2547\",\"name\":\"Crossfit R1\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2547\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2547\\/featured_images\\/13932915_900763556736162_1652653428795979126_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2547\\/featured_images\\/19601307_1144238959055286_3366295853573934480_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2547\\/featured_images\\/26804985_1273644692781378_4479752276507595648_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2547\\/featured_images\\/40139964_1473516179460894_4837375108039311360_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"via Deserto dei Gobi, 44\",\"town\":\"Roma\",\"postal_code\":\"00144\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.8053096,\"longitude\":12.4346704},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitr1.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 347 594 2432\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitr1\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitr1.it\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":\"21563617\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Breizh Crossfit Rennes\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/21563617\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/21563617\\/featured_images\\/aef2d3_36a7ccf493a447e7bc280aeec8d1e063~mv2.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"2 rue du buisson\",\"town\":\"Cesson-S\\u00e9vign\\u00e9\",\"postal_code\":\"35510\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.119472,\"longitude\":-1.602923},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"bzhcrossfitrennes@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"0650634142\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/breizh_crossfit\\/?hl=fr\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/BreizhCrossfitRennes\"}},{\"id_application\":\"81560887\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Louvre \",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/81560887\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/81560887\\/featured_images\\/1.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/81560887\\/featured_images\\/2.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/81560887\\/featured_images\\/3.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/applications\\/81560887\\/featured_images\\/4.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"31 Avenue de l\\u0027Op\\u00e9ra\",\"town\":\"Paris\",\"postal_code\":\"75001\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.8675823,\"longitude\":2.3333093},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"accueil@crossfitlouvre.com\",\"phone\":\"+33 9 62 52 37 66\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitlouvre\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/ReebokCrossFitLouvre\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2881\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Ponferrada\",\"description\":\"CrossFit Ponferrada tiene las mejores instalaciones. Un box amplio con diferentes zonas de entrenamiento, perfecto para practicar CrossFit sin preocuparte por la falta de espacio.  \\u00a1Saca todo tu potencial!\\n\\nNuestras clases est\\u00e1n siempre dirigidas y supervisadas por, al menos, un coach profesional de CrossFit. No importa el nivel que tengas: nos adaptamos a todos los niveles.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2881\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2881\\/featured_images\\/hqdefault.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2881\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Juan de Austria, 8\",\"town\":\"Ponferrada\",\"postal_code\":\"24400\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":42.544861,\"longitude\":-6.6016047},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitponferrada.com\",\"phone\":\"639686904\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitponferrada\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitponferrada\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2849\",\"name\":\"Crossfit La Ribera\",\"description\":\"CrossFit La Ribera , el box con todo lo que usted puede necesitar. Tanto si es un principiante como un atleta experimentado, nuestro equipo est\\u00e1 formado para ayudarle a conseguir sus objetivos. Contamos con lo \\u00faltimo en equipamiento, as\\u00ed como clases con un toque especial que no encontrar\\u00e1 en ninguna otra parte. Cuidamos al detalle la calidad de nuestros servicios.\\n    Tanto si su objetivo es perder peso como tonificar su cuerpo, rehabilitarse de una lesi\\u00f3n o simplemente pas\\u00e1rselo en grande con un grupo de amigos, CrossFit La Ribera tiene lo que usted desea. Nuestra pasi\\u00f3n es la salud y la forma f\\u00edsica, y nuestro objetivo es ser su fuente de bienestar total y vitalidad.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2849\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2849\\/featured_images\\/35575-73173-54264357.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Pol\\u00edgono Industrial 1, Parcela 35\",\"town\":\"Alberic\",\"postal_code\":\"46260\",\"country\":\"Valencia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":39.1269371,\"longitude\":-0.5238257},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitlaribera@hotmail.com\",\"phone\":\"651063967\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitlaribera\",\"facebook\":\"@CrossFit-La-Ribera-842203305863603\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2776\",\"name\":\"Kumuka Crossfit\",\"description\":\"Primer centro oficial CrossFit de la Regi\\u00f3n de Murcia, situado en Cartagena.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2776\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2776\\/featured_images\\/Kumuka-34.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2776\\/featured_images\\/WhatsApp-Image-2016-11-12-at-12.12.31.jpeg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2776\\/featured_images\\/WhatsApp-Image-2017-07-20-at-12.46.15.jpeg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Sofia\",\"town\":\"Cartagena\",\"postal_code\":\"30353\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.6259772,\"longitude\":-0.9546828},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@kumukacrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"629076378\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"kumuka_crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/kumukacrossfitoficial\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3050\",\"name\":\"Triple XXX Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\\u00danico box de Crossfit en C\\u00f3rdoba certificado en Crossfit Kids para educar a los ni\\u00f1os y ni\\u00f1as desde el primer momento en la actividad deportiva. Adem\\u00e1s, disponemos de un espacio de entrenamiento outdoor, y nuestras clases est\\u00e1n adaptadas a todos los niveles.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3050\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3050\\/featured_images\\/Gym-XXX-Crossfit-3-750x418.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3050\\/featured_images\\/hqdefault.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3050\\/featured_images\\/maxresdefault.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Los Alfareros Parcela 119\",\"town\":\"C\\u00f3rdoba\",\"postal_code\":\"14014\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":37.9014128,\"longitude\":-4.7641477},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@triplexxxcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"957 96 20 72\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"triplex.x.x.crossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@triplexxxcrossfit\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2642\",\"name\":\"CrossFit Space 24050\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2642\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2642\\/featured_images\\/35148133_372754456554503_2809732991901761536_o.png\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2642\\/featured_images\\/36742194_393398051156810_7499494154196484096_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2642\\/featured_images\\/46691544_487504655079482_6784403582838898688_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2642\\/featured_images\\/48424725_502402253589722_2473421453303742464_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Via Pascoli, 2\",\"town\":\"Bergamo\",\"postal_code\":\"24050\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.536002,\"longitude\":9.7733635},\"contact_info\":{\"ema