ocation\":{\"latitude\":40.4466511,\"longitude\":-3.9162594},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@cfmajadahonda.com\",\"phone\":\"\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitmajadahonda_oficial\",\"facebook\":\"@crossfitmajadahonda\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2696\",\"name\":\"Dein Crossfit\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2696\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2696\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-img-3995.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2696\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-img-4092.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2696\\/featured_images\\/crossfit-img-4563.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2696\\/featured_images\\/uhr.png\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Ganghoferstra\\u00dfe 3\",\"town\":\"M\\u00fcnchen\",\"postal_code\":\"80339\",\"country\":\"Deutschland\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.1374051,\"longitude\":11.5386425},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@deincrossfit.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 1797812506\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"deincrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/deincrossfit\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2820\",\"name\":\"Condal Crossfit Gracia\",\"description\":\"Condal CrossFit es un box en el que adaptamos cada entrenamiento a tu nivel para que sea cu\\u00e1l sea tu estado f\\u00edsico puedas empezar. Nuestros coaches tienen una larga experiencia en el mundo del CrossFit y cuidan la t\\u00e9cnica al m\\u00e1ximo para que alcances tu mejor nivel f\\u00edsico.\\nQueremos que cuando vengas al box sea la mejor parte de tu d\\u00eda, por eso dise\\u00f1amos cada WOD para que te diviertas, seas m\\u00e1s fuerte y m\\u00e1s \\u00e1gil. Entendemos que CrossFit puede intimidar si no lo has practicado nunca antes, pero no te preocupes, tenemos un programa b\\u00e1sico de iniciaci\\u00f3n para que empieces paso a paso a practicar CrossFit.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2820\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2820\\/featured_images\\/46695196_1948185898602159_1720273610527997952_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2820\\/featured_images\\/condal-crossfit-gracia-2-1000x667.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2820\\/featured_images\\/condal-crossfit-gracia-7-1000x667.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2820\\/featured_images\\/condal-crossfit-gracia-8-1000x667.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Carrer de L\\u0027encarnacio, 20\",\"town\":\"Barcelona\",\"postal_code\":\"08012\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.4057144,\"longitude\":2.1568779},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@condalcrossfit.com\",\"phone\":\"649761006\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"condalcrossfit\",\"facebook\":\"@condalcrossfitbarcelona\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3182\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Rhein Neckar\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3182\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3182\\/featured_images\\/IMG_1689-1024x683.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3182\\/featured_images\\/IMG_8089-1024x683.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3182\\/featured_images\\/IMG_8193-1-1024x648.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3182\\/featured_images\\/IMG_8333-2-1024x683.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Industriestra\\u00dfe 39\",\"town\":\"Mannheim\",\"postal_code\":\"68169\",\"country\":\"Germany\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":49.512997,\"longitude\":8.4676846},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"training@crossfit-rhein-neckar.de\",\"phone\":\"+49 62132869845\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_rhein_neckar\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFitRheinNeckar\"}},{\"id_application\":\"50606909\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit \\u00c9clair\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/50606909\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"60 rue de l\\u0027industrie\",\"town\":\"Buchelay\",\"postal_code\":\"78200\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":48.9867405,\"longitude\":1.6833682},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"contact@crossfiteclair.com\",\"phone\":\"+33628257950\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfiteclair\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossFit-Eclair-%C3%A0-Mantes-Buchelay-112980436902563\\/?ref=page_internal\"}},{\"id_application\":\"43973460\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"CrossFit Heimdall\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/43973460\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"38 Boulevard des Dames\",\"town\":\"Marseille\",\"postal_code\":\"13002\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3021941,\"longitude\":5.3716188},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"ligneaucyril@crossfitheimdall.com\",\"phone\":\"0643038073\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfit_heimdall\",\"facebook\":\"crossfitheimdall\"}},{\"id_application\":\"95767286\",\"id_lead\":null,\"name\":\"Le FOG - Functional Open Gym\",\"description\":\"\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/public-nubapp.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/sport\\/applications\\/95767286\\/logos\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Route de Bazus, 3\",\"town\":\"Garidech\",\"postal_code\":\"31380\",\"country\":\"France\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.7172859,\"longitude\":1.5620819},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"lefog.gym@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"+33645566728\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"lefog_\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/profile.php?id=61557317334869\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2662\",\"name\":\"Crossfit B Side\",\"description\":\"IL CROSSFIT B SIDE A VERONA \\u00c8 LA RISCOPERTA DEL MOVIMENTO.\\n\\nDimenticati noiose palestre di fitness ed esercizi inutili: la nostra mission \\u00e8 quella di perfezionare il movimento dell\\u2019uomo e la sua salute attraverso movimenti funzionali ad alta intensit\\u00e0 costantemente variati: solleva, salta, corri, spingi, tira e arrampica! Da CrossFit B Side si allenano atleti, impiegati, mamme e ragazzi, casalinghe, nonni, Forze dell\\u2019Ordine, corpi militari e disabili per migliorare la loro forma fisica e la loro vita.\\n\\nPer capire davvero cos\\u0027\\u00e8 il CrossFit,\\nil migliore modo \\u00e8 quello di venire a provarlo!\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/29542514_2142838325951911_5875145025669185760_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/30715737_2156555637913513_3598903240785133568_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/47314325_2323576067878135_4881069150371315712_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/48928931_2338385129730562_2893594697962356736_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/53535807_2388617861373955_2618323715611426816_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/54519008_2392333014335773_6154093741759004672_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2662\\/featured_images\\/54727295_2394245434144531_283737780230553600_o.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"via Enrico Fermi, 45\",\"town\":\"Verona\",\"postal_code\":\"37136\",\"country\":\"Italia\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":45.408023,\"longitude\":10.956736},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"info@crossfitbside.com\",\"phone\":\"+39 340 963 2122\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitbside\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/crossfitbside\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"2774\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Soforem Las Rozas\",\"description\":\"El Box es como se llama al lugar donde entrenamos, pero no es solo eso, es un sitio para divertirse, compartir esfuerzo y conocer gente que comparte tu pasi\\u00f3n.\\n\\nLas clases las hacemos todos juntos y se adaptan a tu nivel con plazas limitadas y un coach siempre pendiente de ti.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2774\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2774\\/featured_images\\/10393155_655335767910036_7222300598263321010_n.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/2774\\/featured_images\\/54513627_1272665632900096_3056413424471259080_n.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Calle Helsinki, 4\",\"town\":\"Las Rozas de Madrid\",\"postal_code\":\"28232\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":40.500305,\"longitude\":-3.8897537},\"contact_info\":{\"email\":\"crossfitsoforem@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"916378472\"},\"social_media\":{\"instagram\":\"crossfitsoforem\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/CrossfitSoforem\\/\"}},{\"id_application\":null,\"id_lead\":\"3017\",\"name\":\"Crossfit Scipion\",\"description\":\"Somos el primer Box de CrossFit afiliado de la provincia de Tarragona, somos profesionales, somos tu motivaci\\u00f3n y seremos parte de tu estilo de vida. En CrossFit Scipion disponemos de 700 m2 practicables para entrenar equipados con el mejor material de la mano de marcas como Hatlex, SingularWOD, Rogue, Concept2 . . . \\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nUna zona amplia para realizar los duros entrenamientos  y para los m\\u00e1s halterofilos una tarima con cajones de jerk para practicar de la mejor forma.\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nTodo el material bien cuidado y ordenado. Barras y discos de entrenamiento, kettlebells, mancuernas, cajones, medballs, d-balls, farmers, racks, barra axle, maletas, trineos, bancos de press, remos, assault bikes, cuerdas, peg board, bandas de estiramiento, colchonetas, foam rollers, combas, anillas, GHDs, paralelas . . .\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nZona comunity donde podr\\u00e1s descansar, comer y beber, el lugar perfecto para conversar con tus compa\\u00f1eros antes del entreno y para comentar los resultados tras finalizarlo. En Scipion har\\u00e1s buenas amistades en tus sesiones por que crossfit es m\\u00e1s que un simple entrenamiento y acabar\\u00e1s formando parte de nuestra gran familia con la que sufrir\\u00e1s y disfrutar\\u00e1s cada d\\u00eda, de tus logros.\\n\\n\\nAdem\\u00e1s, tambi\\u00e9n puedes aprovechar para relajar tus m\\u00fasculos en nuestra sala de fisioterapia o para hablar con nuestro nutricionista para mejorar tu alimentaci\\u00f3n. Tambi\\u00e9n desde CrossFit Scipion se organizan clases especiales de halterofilia con los mejores del pa\\u00eds y una serie de seminarios de diferentes \\u00e1mbitos dentro del mundo crossfit de la mano de profesionales.\",\"logo\":\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3017\\/logo\\/logo.png\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3017\\/featured_images\\/16722817_1452585911440005_7229621682015743262_o.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3017\\/featured_images\\/DCw7OdyWAAETIBg%20%281%29.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/nubapp-social.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com\\/leads\\/3017\\/featured_images\\/DCw7OdyWAAETIBg.jpg\"],\"address\":{\"street\":\"Carrer de Joan Amades, 13\",\"town\":\"Reus\",\"postal_code\":\"43205\",\"country\":\"Spain\"},\"location\":{\"latitude\":41.142083,\"longitude\"